<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Irhi Uyohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur Irhi Uyohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Irhi Uyohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Irhi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur</para>
  <para style="mt1">Irhi Uyohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Irhi</para>
  <para style="ip">Uner uwuku utsɛng ubvur uwurɛ awu ukukũ itsoka iki igburh Uyohana. Abɔɔ ikaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ ugɛɛ ra amɛk aki 95 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Unga atsɛng ubvur ha ri ivangyɛ abika adɔsa aka awe ra ayetnum utsɛku umbɔ aka ashupa unga ri iker akũ unga azĩmbɔ ru umpfũwã Ubatmo adene unga umɔ. Ra anang hã unga aka ayɛi irhi iyɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Unga atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ afituwe abika adɔsa ugɛ umbɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker ri imangmang ri ivang ayetnum. Ubvur ha udɛyiwe agben irhi unying anying, akirakɛ abika adɔsa ri ivang hã aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ ahwɛng, bɔr awuri iwu aghoghong ra abirabɛ aka asi iwembɔ abika adɔsa. Nu ngge iki iwe ugɛ anera anyangu agben irhi ha ra atsĩndĩa arhɛrhɛ, bɔr rimi hã undzumu agbena awe ra awiya, iwu ugɛ ru ubok Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo, Unum awuri itsĩme anggamtsaknga kishoo idikũnga unying, nggu Ushaitan. Agãrhãnga awuri ikpombɔ idorh iyi afã aka afa nu abĩ aka afa ri ivangyɛ igha inggbaashe ha iki itsuifɛr.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur ha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 1:1-3">1.1-3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ighwe ri ikikɔng abika adɔsa utɔɔva <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 1:4-8">1.4-8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Irhi Ukiristo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 1:9-20">1.9-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Abvur azĩ ri ikikɔng abika adɔsa utɔɔva <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 2:1-3:22">2.1—3.22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Idzowe igɔng ra afã <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 4:1-11">4.1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ubvur uwuku ufeta nggu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 5:1-8:1">5.1—8.1</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Atsom utɔɔva <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 8:2-11:19">8.2—11.19</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ukutsɛrh nggu ibvui <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 12:1-17">12.1-17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Íjuɛ ivaa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 13:1-18">13.1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Irhi irhɛirhɛ <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 14:1-15:8">14.1—15.8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Itɛ̃rhĩ utɔɔva iyi avɔm Unum <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 16:1-21">16.1-21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Igha inggbaashi ri itsi anggamtsak Unum <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 17:1-20:10">17.1—20.10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Itsu ufai ukpu imaatak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 20:11-15">20.11-15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Afã aka afa nu abĩ aka afa nu Urusharhima uku ufa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 21:1-22:5">21.1—22.5</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Arherhe aki imaatak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 22:6-21">22.6-21</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Ididɛyiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1"/>Irhi Uyesu Ukiristo, iyiriyɛ Unum aka adzowe unga, adɛyiwe agãrhãnga abinkɛ aka awu ufang asi ídãrhũke na akorhe. Unga atsu umbɔ ahwɛng ake ri idene ipfu itsernga ru ugãrhãnga Uyohana, <verse eid="REV 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2"/>uwuku uwe ideka ra abina kishoo unga aka anyã, ake awe Arherhu-Num nu ideka Uyesu Ukiristo. <verse eid="REV 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3"/>Idorh iwe nggu unerwi aka avarhuwe Arherhu-Num akɛrɛ ra anera, nu idorh iwe iyi abirabɛ aka agũ na atɔ̃ itser nggu ake, ubinkutsu ivanga iki iyongge.<verse eid="REV 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ighwe nu ifɛn-Num</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4"/>Umum Uyohana, itsɛnge ikpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa utɔɔva ra abĩ Uasiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Imimuta nu ididɔɔr iwe nggu umbi idzeku unga aka awe icɛrɛ, nu uwu ha aka awe isha, nu uwu ha aka iba, ni idzeku ípfu utɔɔva iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu anang isei Unum, <verse eid="REV 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5"/>ni idzeku Uyesu Ukiristo. Unga awu uwuruwi aka awe idzidzɛrhe ri ideka ha, unga awu uner unggbaashi uwuku usok ra akpe, nu uwuruwi aka agha iyɛrhe ra ayɛrhu upfung.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Unga abema umɛn na afɔrh umɛn ra arhimmɛn nggu adzirhnga. <verse eid="REV 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6"/>Unga atsu umɛn iwe abi Iyɛrhanga na atsu umɛn iwe abika adzowe idɛm-Num abika atɔ̃ itser Unum nu Utɛ. Ru unga ikpikpoi nu ijee iwe ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa! Iwerimi.<verse eid="REV 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7"/>Unyã, unga anu iba nggu amɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">ubɛn asu awuri inyãke unga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">uko abika atar unga ikon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">Nu kishoo idũa ru upfung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">awuri idɔngmbɔ amɛn ru unga.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="REV 1:7">Ngge iwe rimi hã! Iwerimi.<verse eid="REV 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8"/>Uteijee Unum unga agɔr, &lt;&lt;Umum iwu ititirhi ha nu imimasha ha, umum hã iwe icɛrɛ, umum hã iwe isha, umum hã iwe uwuku ububa ha, Unum Uwu Ijee hã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwɔɔ ru nyaku Ungwɛ̃-Ner</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9"/>Umum Uyohana, ungwɛ̃mbi, umɛn iwu urhɔnga ra ayetnum, umɛn iwu urhɔnga ri Iyɛrhe-Num, ikɛi ri idɔngamɛn nu ibibimayɛ umɛn iki iwe ru Uyesu. Atsuke umum ru umpfũwã Ubatmo ri itsi idzowe isarhe Arherhu-Num nu ideka ri itsi Uyesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10"/>Ru Unum ukpu Uteijee, Ipfu-Num iwengge ru umum, ni inggũmum urhɛm ukerketakpɔ ru undzingmum ru nyaki ibar atsom, <verse eid="REV 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11"/>uku ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsɛng ru ubvur uku ufeta abinkɛ ungo uku unyã nu udene umgbɔ uzĩ ru ikpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa ha utɔɔva, abi Uafisa, nu abi Usimirina, nu abi Ubirgamum, nu abi Utiyatira, nu abi Usardi nu abi Ufirhadefiya, nu abi Urhawudikiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12"/>Umum idzipa ibee inyã urhɛm hã uku urherhe nggu umum. Umum iki idzipa umum inyã anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ irhirhang uzinarhi utɔɔva. <verse eid="REV 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13"/>Ra ateu anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ irhirhang hã umum inyã uwɔɔ awu ru nyaku Ungwɛ̃-Ner, atsim atorho akika ader aka atsĩ andaidaknga, unga abow uyim uzinarhi ri ikɔknga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Udan 7.13</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="REV 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14"/>Igwar itsinga iwu uku upɛ̃rhɛ̃ng ru nyaka aghwitu urhurhu, iwu iki iterha ugɛɛ ibur, nu ishaa asunga iwu ugɛɛ ikon urha. <verse eid="REV 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15"/>Adaknga arhang ugɛɛ uzɔu uku ubãrhã umbɔ aka avum ru urha ugbor unai uku umani uku uzhãĩ. Nu urhɛmnga uwu ru nyaku ubvun amɛ̃ azɛ̃ akagɔng. <verse eid="REV 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16"/>Akpɔm nggu idzɛɛr utɔɔva ru ubok ughanga, ra angwĩnga ikon iki ider ighaigharake ibanga ivaa iki idzeka. Unyɛ̃ɛ̃nga urhang ru nyaki ishaa unum iki irhang kishoo nggu ijee ra atenuma. <figure style="fig" alt="Seven lamp stands" file="wa04002b.tif" size="col" loc="1.16" copy="Graham Wade" ref="1.12-16">Anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ irhirhang utɔɔva</figure><verse eid="REV 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17"/>Ivangyɛ umum iki inyã unga, umum igba inũ ra adaknga ru nyaku ukom. Mɔcɛ unga atsorhu ubok ughanga nu umum na agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba ugũo iwei. Awu umum iwe Inggbaashia nu Imaataka. <verse eid="REV 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18"/>Awu umum ibɛk nggu urhɛ, umum iki ikpemum, bɔr icɛrɛ umum iwemum ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa! Umum ikpɔm atsak umukurhi akpe nu anang isei abika akpukpe.<verse eid="REV 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19"/>&lt;&lt;Nggee, utsɛng abinkɛ ungo uku unyã, abinkɛ aka awe icɛrɛ nu abinkɛ aka ikorhe unuma. <verse eid="REV 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20"/>Unyã agben ídzɛɛr utɔɔva ha ungo uku unyã ru ubok ughamum nu anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ irhirhang uzinarhi utɔɔva ha. Idzɛɛr utɔɔva ha iwu ípfu itser-Num utɔɔva iyi ikpui ikikɔng abika adudɔsa utɔɔva ha, ra anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ irhirhang uzinarhi utɔɔva ha iwu ikpui abika adudɔsa utɔɔva.<figure style="fig" alt="Seven churches" file="ldb GPS_SevenChurches_Multi.jpg" size="span" copy="WBT" ref="1.11—3.22">Ikikɔng utɔɔva</figure><verse eid="REV 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Ubvur ha uzĩ ru ukpui ikikɔng <optbreak/> abika adɔsa ru Uafisa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1"/>Utsɛnge ipfu itser-Num iyi ukpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru Uafisa ugɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:1">&lt;&lt;Irhɛm hã iyɛ iki idzeku uwu ha aka akpɔm idzɛɛr utɔɔva ru ubok ughanga, na azɛ̃rhã ra ateu anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ irhirhang uzinarhi utɔɔva ha. <verse eid="REV 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2"/>Umum ihwɛng ikikorhango, ititɛ̃wãngo nu ibibimango. Umum ihwɛng ungo usi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ unekukɔ abi amɛn aka abewe. Ungo uku uvirungo abirabɛ iki iyisa atsimbɔ abi itser Uyesu, na asi iwembɔ rimi, nu ukpo umbɔ agbɛrangwĩ. <verse eid="REV 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3"/>Ungo uku ubima ra ayetnum ri itsokmum, nu usi igũo azhe.<verse eid="REV 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr umum isi igũmum ibɛn abin akɔɔ ru ungo, ubinkutsu, ungo uku unekukɔ abinkɛ ungo uku ubema ri inggbaashia. <verse eid="REV 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5"/>Uyita anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ngo aki inggbaashia aka awe ru ungo udɔrhu ugba! Udzipa ra arhimngo ubvui ukorhe abinngo aki inggbaashia. Ungo uba usi idzipungo, umum iwuri ĩba ru ungo ni itsũwe anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ irhirhangngo ra anangke. <verse eid="REV 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6"/>Bɔr ungo uweɔ ru ubin uku uze ru ungo, ungo uku ukpɛ̃ɔ itser abi Unikorhata, ru nyaka umum iki ikpɛ̃.<verse eid="REV 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7"/>&lt;&lt;Uner ato akika agũ, uneke unga agũ ubinkpi Ipfu-Num iki irherhuwe kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsa ha. Uwuruwi aka abima adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu umum, umum iwuri idzowe unga ijee iyiki igha ikpũrhũ ucucii uwu urhɛ, uwuku uwe ru uzeze icang Unum.<verse eid="REV 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubvur ha uzĩ ru ukpui ikikɔng <optbreak/> abika adɔsa ra abi Usimirina</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8"/>Utsɛnge ipfu itser-Num iyi ukpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru Usimirina ugɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:8">&lt;&lt;Irhɛm hã iyɛ iki idzeku uwu ha aka awu inggbaashia nu imaata, aka akpea na abvui abɛka ikɛi. <verse eid="REV 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9"/>Umum ihwɛng ayetnumngo nu itsũwãngo, bɔr ungo uwu uner ubin! Umum ihwɛng urhena ukpu anera aki irherhuwa ungo ugɛ umbɔ awu abi Uyahuda, na asi iwembɔ abi Uyahuda, bɔr umbɔ awu abi ubã ifɛn Ushaitan. <verse eid="REV 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10"/>Niba ugũo iwei ayetnumkɛ ungo iki ihwa. Umum indɛyiwa ungo, Undenggũ hã awuri itsu abɔɔ ru ugborzĩ avira umbi, nu umbi awuri ihwa uver inuma usɔka. Àka adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker ri imangmangmbi, uko umbi atsĩ ra akpe, umum iwuri idzaamum umbi ifur iyɛrhe iyi urhɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11"/>&lt;&lt;Uner ato akika agũ, uneke unga agũ ubinkpi Ipfu-Num iki irherhuwe kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsa ha! Uwuruwi aka abima adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu umum, akpe aki uvaa asi íkpoke unga.<verse eid="REV 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubvur ha uzĩ ru ukpui ikikɔng <optbreak/> abika adɔsa ru Ubirgamum</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12"/>Utsɛnge ipfu itser-Num iyi ukpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru Ubirgamum ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:12">&lt;&lt;Irhɛm hã iyɛ iki idzeku uwu ha aka akpɔm ikon iki ider ighaigharake iki afɛna avaa. <verse eid="REV 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13"/>Umum ihwɛng anang iseingo, anangkɛ aka awu anang isei Ushaitan. Rimi hã ungo una udɛ̃ɛ̃ usare ri itsokmum. Ungo usi itsɛyingo imangmango ru umum, uko ru unum Uantifa, uwuruwi aka awe idekamum uwu idzidzɛrhe umbɔ aka afɛre ru uteumbi, anangkɛ Ushaitan aka asei.<verse eid="REV 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr umum iwemum ru angwɛ̃rhã abin aka abewe akɔɔ ri itsingo. Aner abɔɔ ru umbi adɔsu imesa Ubarha'am, uwuruwi aki imesuwe Ubarhak unga atsu abi Uisrairha agba ra arhim igha ubinghakpi umbɔ aka adzowe idɛm ra agberhe, nu arhim itoma-dak. <verse eid="REV 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15"/>Rimi hã ungo uku uweɔ ra anera aki idɔsu imesa abi Unikorhata. <verse eid="REV 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16"/>Udzipa ra arhimngo! Iba ishingge rimi, umum ĩba iki ifefetem ru ungo, umum iwuri ikũ ikon iki ider iki idzek ra angwĩmum itang iwa nggu umbɔ.<verse eid="REV 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17"/>&lt;&lt;Uner ato akika agũ, uneke unga agũ ubinkpi Ipfu-Num iki irherhuwe kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsa ha. Uwuruwi aka abima adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu umum, umum iwuri indzowe umannakpi umbɔ aka awɔke. Ikɛi umum iwuri idzowe utarh ukpuku uterhakpi umbɔ aka atsɛng itsok iki ifa ni itsikpɔ, ukpurukpi uwuku uyuyɛi ukpekũ ahwɛng itsok ha.<verse eid="REV 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubvur ha uzĩ ru ukpui ikikɔng <optbreak/> abika adɔsa ru Utiyatira</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18"/>Utsɛnge ipfu itser-Num iyi ukpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru Utiyatira ugɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:18">&lt;&lt;Irhɛm hã iyɛ iki idzeku Ungwɛ̃ Unum, uwuruwi asunga aka awe ru nyaki ikon urha, adaknga aka arhang ugɛɛ uzɔu uku ubãrhã umbɔ aka avum. <verse eid="REV 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19"/>Umum ihwɛng ikikorhango, ibibemango nu imangmango, itserngo nu ibibimango, umum ihwɛng itserngo iyi icɛrɛ inangge iyi inggbaashia.<verse eid="REV 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr uvau uwuruwi umum iki ikpo ungo nggu umgbɔ uwi, ungo uku uneke utsɛrh ha Ujezeberh, aka ayisi itsinga ugɛ unga awu utsɛrh uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num. Ri imesanga, arhɛm agãrhãmum umbɔ atoma-dak ikɛi na agha abinghakɛ aka awu idɛm ra agberhe. <verse eid="REV 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21"/>Umum iki idzowukũ unga ivang unga adzipa ri itser iyiki itoma-daknga, bɔr unga akpɛ̃ɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22"/>Nggee umum iwuri itsuke unga aghong irhãrhã ayetnum ru ukomanga, ikɛi ni itsu abika atoma-dak nggu unga ahwa ayetnum akarhãrhã, umbɔ aba asi idzipumbɔ ri itser iki itãrhãnga. <verse eid="REV 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23"/>Umum iwuri ifɛre angwɛ̃nga. Mɔcɛ kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsa awuri ihwɛngmbɔ ugɛ awu umum uwuku unyã ifɛrhkɔ nu amɛn ubɛn unera, ni iwuri ifai anera ri itseryɛ umbɔ aki itɔ̃.<verse eid="REV 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24"/>&lt;&lt;Umum idɛyiwe abɔɔ ru umbi abika asei ru Utiyatira, umbi abirabɛ aka asi idɔsumbi imesanga nu iyiki ibewa ha umbɔ iki iyisa agɛ, &lt;Iwiwɔk Ushaitan iki iwu ighorghotangge.&gt; Umum isi ítsukamum umbi imor iyɔɔ, <verse eid="REV 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25"/>bɔr àka akpɔm itsermbi utsɛku umum iki ĩba.<verse eid="REV 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26"/>&lt;&lt;Uwuruwi aka abima adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu umum na akorha abinkɛ umum iki ibee utsɛku imimasha, umum iwuri idzowe ijee abĩã kishoo, <verse eid="REV 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27"/>ru nyaka umum iki iyɛi ijee ru Utɛmum.</para>
  <para style="qm1" vid="REV 2:27">&lt;Unga awuri idam umbɔ nggu igbong uzɔu,</para>
  <para style="qm2" vid="REV 2:27">awuri iyatuwe umbɔ ru nyaki inui abĩ.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Amb 2.9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="REV 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28"/>Umum ikɛi iwuri idzowe unga idzɛɛr iyi igɔ̃ ukpee. <verse eid="REV 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29"/>Uner ato akika agũ, uneke unga agũ ubinkpi Ipfu-Num iki irherhuwe kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsa ha.<verse eid="REV 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ubvur ha uzĩ ru ukpui ikikɔng <optbreak/> abika adɔsa ru Usardi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1"/>Utsɛnge ipfu itser-Num iyi ukpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru Usardi ugɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:1">&lt;&lt;Irhɛm hã iyɛ iki idzeku uwu ha aka akpɔm ipfu utɔɔva iyi Unum nu idzɛɛr utɔɔva ha. Umum ihwɛng ikikorhango, anera akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ ungo uweɔ ru urhɛ, bɔr ungo uku ukpeɔ. <verse eid="REV 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2"/>Uzir! Nu ufituwe abinkɛ aka abɔr, aka awuri ikpe, ubinkutsu, umum isi inyã itserngo imaangge ra asu Unummum. <verse eid="REV 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3"/>Nggee, uyita ubinkpi ungo uku uyɛi nu ugũ, udɔsa ake, nu udzipa. Ungo uba usi izirɔ, umum iwuri ĩba ru nyaku uvɛu, ungo usi íhwɛngo ivangyɛ umum iki ĩba ru ungo.<verse eid="REV 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4"/>&lt;&lt;Bɔr ungo uweɔ ra anera ukunjiir ru Usardi umbɔ aka anasi itsu atorhambɔ adzurke arhim. Umbɔ awuri izɛ̃rhã nggu umum, awuri itsim atorho aka aterha, ubinkutsu, umbɔ amɛ̃mbɔ. <verse eid="REV 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5"/>Uwuruwi aka abima adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu umum, awuri itsime unga atorho akaterha ru nyaka umbɔ. Umum isi ítsũwũkũ itsokmbɔ ru ubvur urhɛ. Bɔr umum iwuri indɛyikũ Utɛmum nu ípfu itsernga ugɛ umbɔ awu abimum. <verse eid="REV 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6"/>Uner ato akika agũ, uneke unga agũ ubinkpi Ipfu-Num iki irherhuwe kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsa ha.<verse eid="REV 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubvur ha uzĩ ru ukpui ikikɔng <optbreak/> abika adɔsa ru abi Ufirhadefi</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7"/>Utsɛnge ipfu itser-Num iyi ukpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru Ufirhadefiya ugɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:7">&lt;&lt;Irhɛm hã iyɛ iki idzeku asarkasar uner idzidzɛrhe ha, unga aka akpɔm utsak umukurhi Udauda. Uwuruwi iki itsuri uwuku ufɔme ashia, ikɛi unga aba afɔmuka uwuku utsutsuri ashia. <verse eid="REV 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8"/>Umum ihwɛng ikikorhango. Unyã, umum iki itsuruwamum ungo angwĩ ubã akirakɛ unera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ afɔmuka. Umum ihwɛng ikerngo iwu ukunjiir, rimi hã ungo ukpɔm arherhamum nu usi itsɛyingo itsokmum. <verse eid="REV 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9"/>Abika awu ru ubã ifɛn Ushaitan, abika ayisa atsimbɔ ugɛ umbɔ awe abi Uyahuda na asi iwembɔ, umbɔ agbɛrangwĩ, umum iwuri itsuke umbɔ aba agba ra adakngo na ahwɛng agɛ umum ibema ungo. <verse eid="REV 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10"/>Ngge iki iwe ugɛ ungo ubimu udɔsungo ubinkpi umum iki itsuk. Umum iwuri ikakamum ungo ri ivang iyiki ivirayɛ iki ibawe upfunga kishoo, umbɔ aki ivira anera aka asei nu abĩ.<verse eid="REV 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11"/>&lt;&lt;Umum isi índãrhũmum ni ĩba. Ukpɔm ubin uku uwe ukpungo, utsur unera avura ifur iyɛrhango. <verse eid="REV 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12"/>Uwuruwi aka abima adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu umum, umum iwuri itsuke unga awu ugban ri Iya-Nummum. Asi íbvui nekuka anang hã. Umum iwuri itsɛng itsok Unummum ni itsi uner ha nu itsok uteu Unummum, Urusharhima uku ufa, ukpurukpi uku idzeku Unummum ra afã ucipuwa. Ikɛi umum iwuri itsɛng itsokmum iki ifa ni itsinga. <verse eid="REV 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13"/>Uner ato akika agũ, uneke unga agũ ubinkpi Ipfu-Num iki irherhuwe kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsa ha!<verse eid="REV 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubvur ha uzĩ ru ukpui ikikɔng <optbreak/> abika adɔsa ru abi Urhawudiki</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14"/>Utsɛnge ipfu itser-Num iyi ukpui ikikɔng abika adɔsa ru abi Urhawudikiya ugɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:14">&lt;&lt;Irhɛm hã iyɛ iki idzeku Iwerimi, uwu ha aka awu idzidzɛrhe ri ideka, uwuku ugha iyɛrhe abin Unum aka amuna. <verse eid="REV 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15"/>Umum ihwɛng ikikorhango, ungo usi ighɛngungo, ungo usi imanungo. Umum ibee ungo uwe uku ughɛɛng use uku umani! <verse eid="REV 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16"/>Ubinkutsu, ungo uwu ra ateu, ungo usi iweɔ uku ughɛɛng, ungo usi imanungo, umum iwuri itare ungo udzeka ra angwĩmum. <verse eid="REV 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17"/>Ungo ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;Umum iwu uner ubin, umum iwu ra abin upfung, umum isi ĩbeemum ubin.&gt; Bɔr ungo umɔrɔ ungo uwu uner ida ugarh, ubin atorh, uner itsũwã, uner ibvuta, nu uwu igbĩrhĩ. <verse eid="REV 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18"/>Nggee, umum ĩdzaa ungo itsũwã ugoi uzinarhi ru umum, uzinarhi uku uterhakpi umbɔ aka asui ru urha, ngge itsú ungo ukpo iwu ru ubin, nu ugoi atorho aka aterha ungo iki itsime igbĩrhãngo utsir atsak, nu ugoi agɔu usu utsu ra asungo, ngge itsú ungo udɛ̃ɛ̃ unyãɔ.<verse eid="REV 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19"/>&lt;&lt;Umum iki isaki itsɛrhe ni imesuwe amɛn ra abirabɛ umum iki ibema. Nggee utsu amɛnngo, nu udzipa. <verse eid="REV 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20"/>Umumwi! Idɛ̃ɛ̃ ra angwĩ ubã ni ikwɛr. Unera aba agũa urhɛmmum na atsurunga angwĩ ubã hã, umum iwuri itsĩmum igha nggu unga, nu unga nggu umum.<verse eid="REV 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21"/>&lt;&lt;Uwuruwi aka abima adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu umum, umum iwuri itsuke unga asei nggu umum nu anang iseimum, ru nyaka umum iki ibima ru upfung ni isei nggu Utɛmum ra anang iseinga icɛrɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22"/>Uner ato akika agũ, uneke unga agũ ubinkpi Ipfu-Num iki irherhuwe kishoo ikikɔng abika adɔsa ha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Anang isei ra afã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1"/>Akɛrɛ ha aka amaa kishoo umum irhi, inyã angwĩ ubã aka atsuri adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asumum ra afã. Urhɛm ukpu ha umum iki igũ uni irherhe nggu umum, uwu urhɛm hã umum iki igũ ugɛɛ ibar utsom ri inggbaashia, ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Ufũwã nggɛɛ, nu umum idɛyiwa ungo ubinkpi uku uwu ufang ukpɔ uku ikorhe akɛrɛ ha ake aba amaake.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2"/>Kanying Ipfu-Num iwengge ru umum, umum inyã ra asumum anang isei ra afã uner uwɔɔ aka asei umɔ. <verse eid="REV 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3"/>Uwuku usei ra anang isei ha arhang ru nyaka amasarha akika awu ru ugarh, aki ujasfa nu ukanorhiya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ujasfa nu ukanorhiya awe atarhkɛ aka awe ru ugarh ru nyaki ibãrhã.</char></note> Ikon inai ngge ini idziirte anang isei ha nggu irhirhang ru nyaku utarh uzumurudu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uzumurudu uwe utarhkpi uku uwe ru ugarh ukpu amɛ̃ ubĩĩ.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4"/>Udziirte ra anang isei ha ikɛi anang isei akɔɔ isɔka ivaa nu anaa, akirakɛ akakũ isɔka ivaa nu anaa aka asei nu ake. Atsim nggu atorho aka aterha nu ifur iyɛrhe uzinarhi nu atsimbɔ. <verse eid="REV 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5"/>Ra anang isei ha irhirhang nu irhirhare inai iki idzeyiwa. Udika asu anang isei ha, irhirhang utɔɔva iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ igar, akɛrɛ ha awu ípfu-Num utɔɔva ha. <verse eid="REV 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6"/>Udika asu anang isei ha ikɛi ubina nukpɔ ru nyaku ukau ukugɔng umbɔ aka agbisha ukpɔ nggu irhi, urhang ukupɛ̃rhɛ̃ng ru nyaku irhi nú unum.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Akan udziirte ra ateu anang isei ha ubɛn ubanga, abin akika amumuna anaa aki urhɛ nggu isha asu irhɛirhɛ iki iwe ra asu nu andzingngge. <verse eid="REV 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7"/>Ubin urhɛ ukpu inggbaashia uwe ru nyaku utɛ̃rhĩmi, ukpu uvaa uwe ru nyaki inak iki itsak, ubin ukpu untaar asuke awe ru nyaka aki unera, ubin ukpu unaa ikɛi uwe ru nyaki isew iyiki isoka afɛk. <verse eid="REV 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8"/>Ubɛn abin akika amumuna aki urhɛ ha ikinanake awu ra afɛka utɔ̃ĩ, akan udziirte iyormbɔ awe nggu íshaa usu nggu afɛkmbɔ. Nu utsuu nu atenum umbɔ asi inekukumbɔ itsusa ambom agɛ,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">&lt;&lt;Usarkasar, usarkasar, usarkasar,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Uteijee Unum Uner Ijee!</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Unga awu isha nu icɛrɛ,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">nu uwuku ububa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9"/>Abin urhɛ akika amumuna hã aki isaka ikpoi, adzowe igɔng nu itanga awɛɛ ru uwuku usei nu anang isei ha, uwu ha aka awe ru urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="REV 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10"/>Mɔcɛ akakũ isɔka ivaa nu anaa hã aka isaka agba anu ra asu uwuku usei nu anang isei ha, adzowe unga igɔng, unga aka abɛk ugbagbaa. Umbɔ aka isaka angwɛ̃we ifur iyɛrhambɔ ra abĩ ra asu anang isei ha, na agɛ,<verse eid="REV 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11"/>&lt;&lt;A Uteijee Unummɛn, ungo umɛ̃ngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">uyɛi ikpikpoi, nu imor, nu ijee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Ubinkutsu, awu ungo umuna abina kishoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">ikɛi awu ibibemango ake aka awe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">na awe ru iyor.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ubvur uku ufeta nu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã ubvur uku ufeta ru ubok ughanga unga aka akpɔm ra anang iseinga ha uku ufeta nggu itsɛng ru ubɛn ibanga iki ivarhangge na aborhe nggu ibiborh utɔɔva. <verse eid="REV 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2"/>Ni inyã nggaa ipfu itser-Num iki itsarhi irhakngge idũwã igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungaa adɛ̃ɛ̃ amɛ̃ ibuur ibiborh ha na ayangu ubvur ha?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3"/>Bɔr unera ashia ra afã use nu abĩ use ru unɔrkang abĩ aka idɛ̃ɛ̃ ayangu ubvur ha use avarha umgbɔ. <verse eid="REV 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4"/>Umum iciu akpe ni iciu ubinkutsu, asi ikpombɔ unera aka idɛ̃ɛ̃ amɛ̃ɛ̃ iyangu ubvur ha use adɛ̃ɛ̃ avarha umgbɔ. <verse eid="REV 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5"/>Mɔcɛ ukukũ uwɔɔ agɔr umum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba uciupɔ akpe! Unyã, Utɛ̃rhĩmi uwu unui Uyahuda, Unang Udauda, aka ananga anggamtsaknga. Unga adɛ̃ɛ̃ amɛ̃ɛ̃ ibuur ibiborh utɔɔva ha na ayangu ubvur ha.&gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="Scroll with seven seals" file="gt00149.tif" size="col" loc="5.5" copy="Gordon Thompson" ref="5.1">Ubvur nggu ibiborh utɔɔva</figure><verse eid="REV 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ ugɛɛ aka angwã ngge, idɛ̃ɛ̃ ikhapa ra anang isei ha, nggu abin urhɛ akika amumuna ikinanake nu akakũ ha aka akan adziira unga. Unga awu ra atsom utɔɔva nu asu utɔɔva akirakɛ aka awe ípfu utɔɔva iyi Unum aka adene ngge ru upfunga kishoo. <verse eid="REV 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7"/>Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha azĩ ayɛi ubvur uku ufeta ha ru ubok ugha uwu ha aka asei ra anang isei ha. <verse eid="REV 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8"/>Ivangyɛ aka ayɛi ubvur uku ufeta ha, abin akika amumuna aki urhɛ ha ikinanake nu akakũ isɔka ivaa na anaa hã agba anu ra asu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha. Ubɛn unera ru umbɔ akpɔm igbɔm nu itɛ̃rhĩ iyi uzinarhi nggu abin isung, ake awu ifɛn-Num abika adɔsa. <verse eid="REV 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9"/>Atsũ ubom uku ufa agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">&lt;&lt;Imɛ̃ngge ungo uyɛi ubvur uwuku ufeta ha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">nu ubuute ibiborh ake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">ubinkutsu, aka afɛrmbɔ ungo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">nggu adzirhngo, ungo uku ukũ ufai anera ru Unum</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">ru ubɛn anuisa nu idũa nu anera nu abĩã.<verse eid="REV 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10"/>Ungo utsu umbɔ awe abi iyɛrhango nu abika adzowe idɛm-Num,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">na atɔ̃ itser Unummɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">na agha iyɛrhe ra abĩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã ni igũ irhɛm ípfu itser-Num irhɛirhɛ, iki iwe anaka agɔnga arhɛrhɛ. Akan adziir anang isei ha, nu abin akika amumuna ha aki urhɛ nu akakũ ha ikɛi. <verse eid="REV 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12"/>Atsarhi irhakmbɔ atsusa ambom agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">&lt;&lt;Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha umbɔ aka afɛre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">imɛ̃ngge unga ayɛi ijee, ni iwe ru ubin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">nu itsoi, nu iker,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">nu igɔng, nu ikpikpoi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13"/>Mɔcɛ umum igũ kishoo abinkɛ umbɔ aka amuna ra afã nu abĩ, nu unɔrkang abĩ, nu akau akagɔng, nu kishoo abin urhɛ aka awe ra ake, atsusa ambom agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">&lt;&lt;Ru unga uwuku usei ra anang isei ha nu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">ikpikpoi nu igɔng, nu imor nu ijee iyi ugbagbaa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14"/>Abin akika amumuna aki urhɛ ha ikinanake agɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Iwerimi!&gt;&gt; Nu akakũ hã agba anu na adzowe igɔng.<verse eid="REV 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Ibiborh utɔɔva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1"/>Umum iki inyã Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha iki ikhor ibiborh unying ru utɔɔva ha, ri imimuna hã ikinanake umum igũ unying iki itsarhi irhakngge ru nyaki inai iki irhare igɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã inyãwã iyiki iterha! Uwuku ufũ ngge akpɔm nggu utɔɔ, aka adzowe unga nggu ifur iyɛrhe. Unga adzek ru nyaku unggang, abee iwu ungganga.<verse eid="REV 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3"/>Ivang Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha iki ikhor ibiborh iyi uvaa, umum igũ uwu uvaa ra abin akika amumuna aki urhɛ ha ikinanake agɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4"/>Mɔcɛ inyãwã iyɔɔ idzeka, iwu iyiki ibãrhã. Umbɔ adzowe uwuku ufũ ngge ijee iyiki inyãnguwe ididɔɔr ru upfung, ngge itsú anera agbɛyi adɔka. Adzowe unga nggaa ikon iki ider.<verse eid="REV 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5"/>Ivang Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha iki ikhor ibiborh iyi untaar, umum igũ imimuna iyi untaar ra abin akika amumuna hã ikinanake aki urhɛ ha iki igɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba!&gt;&gt; Mɔcɛ umum inyã inyãwã iyiki ifĩrhã. Uwuku ufũ ngge akpɔm nggu ubin ukpuku umei imor abin ru uboknga. <verse eid="REV 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6"/>Mɔcɛ umum igũ ubin ukpɔɔ ru nyaku urhɛm uku udzeki imimuna hã ikinanake aki urhɛ ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Imang ugbiu itsem unying iwu imang itser unuma unying, imang ugbiu ishaa abvur ataar iwu imang itser unuma unying, bɔr niba udakukɔ atsei uzaitun nu amɛ̃ inebi!&gt;&gt; <figure style="fig" alt="Scales (thing for measuring weight of things)" file="hk00156b.tif" size="col" loc="6.6" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="6.5">Ubin uwuku umei imor abin</figure><verse eid="REV 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7"/>Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha aka akhor ibiborh iyi unaa, umum igũ urhɛm imimuna iyi urhɛ ikinanake igɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8"/>Mɔcɛ umum irhi inyã inyãwã iyɔɔ iyorngge iki isatungge! Uwuku ufũ iyi ha itsoknga igburh Akpe, anang isei abika akpukpe ikɛi adɔsa ru unga. Umbɔ adzowe umbɔ ijee ri itsi ukpusha unying ra anaa (1/4) aki upfung, umbɔ afɛyiwe nggu ikon iki ider, nu imerh, nu ikpo, nu íjuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe iyi upfung.<verse eid="REV 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9"/>Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha aka akhor ibiborh iyi untɔ̃ɔ̃, umum inyã ra anɔnɔr ubeu ha ípfu abirabɛ umbɔ aka afɛr ra Arherhu-Num nu idekambɔ aka abima. <verse eid="REV 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10"/>Umbɔ atsarhi irhakmbɔ agɛ, &lt;&lt;A Uteijee uner ijee kishoo, usarkasar uner idzidzɛrhe, ukang ungo uku udɔrhu utsu uvau ru aner upfung ukpirɛ, nu utsuke umbɔ afai ubinkutsu, umbɔ afɛre umɛn?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ adzowe ubɛn unera ru umbɔ atorho aka ader aka aterha, na asɔme umbɔ adãrhã ukunjiir utsɛku umbɔ aka imaa ifɛre angwɛ̃mbɔ nu anapumbɔ, abirabɛ aka awu andɔki itsermbɔ ru nyaka umbɔ aka afɛr umbɔ.<verse eid="REV 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12"/>Umum iki inyã Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha iki ikhor ibiborh iyi utɔ̃ĩ, umɔ nggaa izizusa abĩ iki ikorhe. Ishaa unum idzipa iwu iki ifĩrhã ru nyaki igwar ibũ, ufɛ̃ udzipu uwe uku ubãrhã ru nyaka adzirh. <verse eid="REV 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13"/>Ídzɛɛr afã igbei ra abĩ, ru nyaki ikpũrhã uvorhvoyɛ iki ibĩ akarhãrhã, ugba uku uker uzung ngge nu ucuciiangge, ngge ipupi igba. <verse eid="REV 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14"/>Afã afeta ru nyaka umbɔ iki ifetu ufar, atsusuwe igũ nu ampfũwã ra anangke.<verse eid="REV 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15"/>Mɔcɛ ayɛrhe upfung ukpirɛ, nu anggbaashi anera, nu anggbaashi abi iwa abika agɔng, nu abika awe ru ubin, nu abi ijee, nu kishoo anera, agãrhã nu abirabɛ aka asi iwembɔ agãrhã, awoyi ra atai nu ífa iyi ígũ. <verse eid="REV 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16"/>Anu iyisi ígũ nu ífa agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka agbei nu atsimɛn na atsire umɛn ra asu uwu ha aka asei nu anang isei ha, nu avɔm Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha. <verse eid="REV 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17"/>Ubinkutsu, nggaa unum avɔm uku ubakpɔ, ungaa idɛ̃ɛ̃ abɛk?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Anaka agɔnga unaka <optbreak/> nu anaka agɔnga isɔka inaa <optbreak/> nu anaka agɔnga anaa (144,000) <optbreak/> umbɔ aka atsuke atsar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1"/>Akɛrɛ aka amaa umum inyã ípfu itser-Num inaa iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ nu anggbokunga anaa aki upfung. Ikɛnngge ubɛn ugba ififɛu nu abĩ ru anggbokunga anaa hã, use ukau ukugɔng use acucii. <verse eid="REV 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã ipfu itser-Num iyɔɔ iki idze udiku igɔ̃kpee ifũrhũwa, ikpɔm nggu utsar ukpu Unum uwu urhɛ. Ayisu ípfu itser-Num inaa hã iyiriyɛ Unum aka adzowe ijee ngge idakuwe abĩ nu ukau ukugɔng hã. <verse eid="REV 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3"/>Ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba adakukumbi abĩ use ukau ukugɔng use acucii, utsɛku umum iki itsuke agãrhũ Unum atsar ra ashimbɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ asɔma umum irhɛ abirabɛ umbɔ aka atsuke atsar ha, Anaka agɔnga unaka nu anaka agɔnga isɔka inaa nu anaka agɔnga anaa (144,000). Umbɔ aka adzeka ri idũa usɔkdũmɛn aki Uisrairha kishoo.<verse eid="REV 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5"/>Atsuke atsar ra anera, anaka agɔnga usɔkdũmɛn (12,000) ri idũ iyi Uyahuda.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">Atsuke anaka agɔnga usɔka nu anaka agɔnga avaa (12,000) ri idũ iyi Uruben.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">Atsuke (12,000) ri idũ iyi Ugad.<verse eid="REV 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6"/>Atsuke anaka agɔnga usɔka nu anaka agɔnga avaa (12,000) ri idũ iyi Uasher.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">Atsuke anaka agɔnga usɔka nu anaka agɔnga avaa (12,000) ri idũ iyi Unaftarhi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">Atsuke anaka agɔnga usɔka nu anaka agɔnga avaa (12,000) ri idũ iyi Umanase.<verse eid="REV 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7"/>Atsuke anaka agɔnga usɔka nu anaka agɔnga avaa (12,000) ri idũ iyi Usimiyon.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">Atsuke anaka agɔnga usɔka nu anaka agɔnga avaa (12,000) ri idũ iyi Urhawi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">Atsuke anaka agɔnga usɔka nu anaka agɔnga avaa (12,000) ri idũ iyi Uisakar.<verse eid="REV 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8"/>Atsuke anaka agɔnga usɔka nu anaka agɔnga avaa (12,000) ri idũ iyi Uzeburhun.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">Atsuke anaka agɔnga usɔka nu anaka agɔnga avaa (12,000) ri idũ iyi Uyusuf.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">Atsuke anaka agɔnga usɔka nu anaka agɔnga avaa (12,000) ri idũ iyi Ubanjami.<verse eid="REV 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nggaa ikikɔng anera iki itsim <optbreak/> atorho aka aterha aka ader</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9"/>Akɛrɛ aka amaa, umum inyã nggaa ikikɔng irhɛirhɛ unera aka asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ avarhunga, iki idzeka ru abĩã, nu anera, nu anuisa, nu idũa kishoo, adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu anang isei ha nu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha. Umbɔ atsim atorho aka ader aka aterha na akpɔm nggu angbɔk irhek ra abokmbɔ. <verse eid="REV 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10"/>Atsarhi irhakmbɔ agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">&lt;&lt;Ififɔrh iwe iyi Unummɛn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">uwuku usei nu anang isei ha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">nu iyi Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha ikɛi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11"/>Kishoo ípfu itser-Num idɛ̃ɛ̃ idziirte anang isei ha, nu akakũ ha, nu imimuna abin urhɛ ha ikinanake. Umbɔ agba anu ra asu anang isei ha, adzowe igɔng ru Unum, <verse eid="REV 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12"/>agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">&lt;&lt;Iwerimi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Ikpikpoi, nu imor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">nu itsoi, nu itar uwɛɛ, nu igɔng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">nu ijee, nu iker</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">iwe ru Unummɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Iwerimi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13"/>Mɔcɛ unying ra akakũ hã arhusa umum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Abɛrɛ abika atsim atorho aka aterha aka ader ha, awu umbɔ ungaa? Ikɛi umbɔ adzeki inɛ̃ɛ̃?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14"/>Umum ĩgɔr inggɛ, &lt;&lt;A uteiya ungo uhwɛngo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Unga agɔr umum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Anera abɛrɛ adzeka ru nggaa uver ayetnum, umbɔ asorh atorha aka adermbɔ ra adzirh Ungwɛ̃ itsurhi ha, ake awu aka aterha. <verse eid="REV 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15"/>Nggee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">&lt;&lt;Umbɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu anang isei Unum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">anu itɔ̃we unga itser ru untsuu nu atenum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">ri Iya-Num.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">Unga uwuku asei nu anang isei ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">awuri itar utsurhanga atsire umbɔ.<verse eid="REV 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16"/>Asi íbvui agũmbɔ imerh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">asi íbvui agũmbɔ ugɔ̃ amɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">Asi íbvui agũmbɔ imani unum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">use imani iyɔɔ.<verse eid="REV 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17"/>Ubinkutsu, Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">aka asei akhapa ra ateu anang isei ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">unga awuri idzɛu umbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">unga awuri ikũna umbɔ azĩ ra akwiu amɛ̃ urhɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">Unum awuri ifiruka kishoo anyĩ ra asumbɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ibiborh iyi utɔɔva nu umoshu <optbreak/> uzinarhi isung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1"/>Ivang Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha iki ikhor ibiborh iyi utɔɔva, afã asei ukutata utsɛku uteng ukara unying.<verse eid="REV 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã ípfu itser-Num utɔɔva iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu Unum, umbɔ adzowe umbɔ atsom utɔɔva.<verse eid="REV 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyɔɔ, ikpɔm nggu umoshu uzinarhi isung, iba idɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu ubeu ha. Umbɔ adzowe unga isung irhɛirhɛ unga aka itoma nggu ifɛn-Num iyi abika adɔsa, unga aka adzowe umgbɔ nu ubeu uzinarhi uwuku uwe ra asu anang isei ha. <verse eid="REV 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4"/>Azoo isung hã nggu ifɛn-Num abika adɔsa ha adzeku ubok ipfu itser-Num hã, afũ azĩke ra asu Unum. <verse eid="REV 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5"/>Mɔcɛ ipfu itser-Num inyãngu umoshu uzinarhi uwu isung hã, itsũ urha nu ubeu ha itsu ru umosha ha ni itare umgbɔ ru upfunga. Umgbɔ ukũ irhirhang inyaka, nu irhare inai, nu izizusa abĩ.<verse eid="REV 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atsom hã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6"/>Mɔcɛ ípfu itser-Num hã utɔɔva iki ikpɔm atsom hã idzɛu ibar ake.<verse eid="REV 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi inggbaashia ibar utsomngge, umɔ atarh inai nu urha ukayi nggu adzirh na atare ru upfung. Urha ukpĩĩwe ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki upfung, ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki acucii, nu kishoo ubĩĩ uku usum ukpĩĩkpɔ.<verse eid="REV 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi uvaa ibar utsomngge, ubin ukpɔɔ ru nyaku nggaa igũ ikpĩĩ urha, umbɔ atare ngge ru ukau ukugɔng. Ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki ukau ukugɔng hã udzipa uwu adzirh, <verse eid="REV 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9"/>ugbɛra unying ru agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki imimuna abin aki urhɛ aka awe ru ukau ukugɔng hã akpeke, nu akhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) atsĩmke.<verse eid="REV 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi untaar ibar utsomngge, nggaa idzɛɛr iyiki irhang ugɛɛ urha iki idzeka afã icipuwa, iba igba ru ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki azɛ̃ nu akwiu amɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11"/>Itsok idzɛɛr ha igburh &lt;&lt;Ikpere.&gt;&gt; Atsu ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki amɛ̃ hã awu uku ukpere, anera arhɛrhɛ abika ahwa amɛ̃ ikpere ha akpeyimbɔ.<verse eid="REV 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi unaa ibar utsomngge, umbɔ akwɛr ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki ishaa unum, ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki ufɛ̃, nu ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki ídzɛɛr. Ngge itsú irhirhangmbɔ idzipa iwe uzĩ, nu ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki atenum asi irhangke, rimi hã ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar aki utsuu asi irhangke.<verse eid="REV 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13"/>Umum iki irhi inyã, umum igũ isew iyɔɔ iyiki itĩ ra afɛk afafã iciu akpe ikerketangge, igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Atorh! Atorh! Atorh ra abirabɛ aka asei ru upfunga kishoo, ubinkutsu atsom akirakɛ ípfu itser-Num ikitatangge iki ibɔr, umum ibee ibar atsomngge!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Utsom ukpu untɔ̃ɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi untɔ̃ɔ̃ ibar utsomngge, umum inyã idzɛɛr iki idzeka afã iba igba ra abĩ. Umbɔ adzowe ngge utsak umukurhi utsim angwĩ aka awe aghoghotake. <verse eid="REV 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2"/>Ivangyɛ ngge iki itsuri angwĩ hã, azoo adzek ru nyaka akirakɛ aki idzek ru nggaa ugbor unai, utsɛku azoo ha atsu ishaa unum nu amɛɛ awu uzĩ. <verse eid="REV 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3"/>Ru azoo ha asusu adzek acipuwa nu abĩ, umbɔ adzowe ake ijee iyiki ititang ru nyaki ínna ra abĩ. <verse eid="REV 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4"/>Agɔr ake agɛ ake niba atsĩmkuke ubĩĩ use acucii use ubɛn ubin ukpuku umumɛr ra abĩ, bɔr akpurha atang anera aka ashimbɔ ru utsar ideka iyi Unum nu ashimbɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5"/>Asi idzowukumbɔ ijee iyiki ifɛre anera, bɔr adzowe umbɔ uver ukpekũ ukpu afɛ̃ɛ̃ atɔ̃ɔ̃. Uver ha uwe ru nyaki inna iki itar unera. <verse eid="REV 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6"/>Ri inum hã anera akpurha abee akpe, bɔr umbɔ asi íkpombɔ akpe ha. Umbɔ awuri ikpona akpe, bɔr akpe ha awuri ikpɛ̃ke ibiba.<verse eid="REV 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7"/>Asusu ha awu ru nyaki ínyãwã iyiki ibee itang iwa, ra atsi ake atsim ífur iyɛrhe uzinarhi, unyɛ̃ɛ̃ke awe ru nyaku unyɛ̃ɛ̃ anera. <verse eid="REV 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8"/>Igwarke iwe ru nyaki igwar akatsɛrh, anyĩke awe ru nyaka aki utɛ̃rhĩmi. <verse eid="REV 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9"/>Atsime abina ni ikɔkuke ugɛɛ atorho uzɔu, irhak afɛkuke iwe ru nyaki ínyãwã iyiki iwe ru íkar utser ri iwa. <verse eid="REV 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10"/>Aweke ra asĩ na atang ru nyaki ínna, ra asĩke aweke ri ijee iyiki idzowe anera uver afɛ̃ɛ̃ atɔ̃ɔ̃. <verse eid="REV 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11"/>Aweke ru uyɛrhe, unga awu ipfu itser-Num hã umbɔ aka adzowe ijee nu angwĩ aka aghor ha. Itsoka ri idũ abi Uyahuda igburh, &lt;&lt;Uabaddo.&gt;&gt; Ri idũ abi Uherhini igburh, &lt;&lt;Uaforhiyon,&gt;&gt; agbena &lt;&lt;Uwuku udakuwe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12"/>Atorh aki inggbaashia aka atɔngke, abɔr atorh akɔɔ avaa aka iba.<verse eid="REV 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsom ukpu utɔ̃ĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13"/>Mɔcɛ ipfu itser-Num iyi utɔ̃ĩ ibar utsomngge, umum igũ urhɛm uku udzeka ra atsom anaa hã aki ubeu uzinarhi ra asu Unum. <verse eid="REV 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14"/>Urhɛm hã ugɔr ipfu itser-Num iyi utɔ̃ĩ hã iki ikpɔm atsom hã ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Ugarhuwe ípfu itser-Num hã ikinanangge umbɔ aka abow ru nggaa azɛ̃ Uyuferiti!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15"/>Umbɔ agarhuwe ípfu itser-Num hã ikinanangge iyiriyɛ umbɔ aka aden adzɛu ivang iyɛrɛ iyi unum ukpirɛ ukpu ufɛ̃ uwurɛ nu amɛka akɛrɛ, atsũwe umbɔ afɛre ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) ru kishoo angwɛ̃ anera. <verse eid="REV 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16"/>Irhɛ abi iwa aka afũ ínyãwã itsĩngge andena inaka ivaa (200,000,000). Umum igũmum irhɛmbɔ.<verse eid="REV 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17"/>Ínyãwã hã nu abika afũ ngge, umum inyã ri irhi iwe ri iminɛ, atorho ikɔkmbɔ awu uku uzhãĩ, ru nyaku amɛ̃ imũrhũm, nu undzuna. Atsi inyãwã hã awe ru nyaka atsi atɛ̃rhĩmi, urha nu azoo nu urha uku uterha adzeyiwa ra angwĩngge. <verse eid="REV 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18"/>Ugbɛra unying ra ataar (1/3) aki anera umbɔ afɛre nggu ikpo urha, nu azoo, nu urha uku uterha ha uku udzeyiwa ra angwĩ inyãwã hã. <verse eid="REV 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19"/>Ijee ínyãwã hã iwu ra angwĩngge nu asĩngge. Asĩngge awu ru nyaka íbvui iyiki iwu ra atsi, akũ ake anayiwe anera.<verse eid="REV 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20"/>Anera abɔɔ aka asi ikũ ikpo ha afɛrmbɔ umbɔ, ana akpɛ̃mbɔ idzipa aneke abinkɛ umbɔ aka akũ abokmbɔ akorhe, asi inekukumbɔ idzowe igɔng ri ípfu iyiki ibewe, nu agberhe uzinarhi, uazurhfa, uzɔu uku ubãrhã, atarh, acucii, abinkɛ aka asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ anyãke use agũke use azɛ̃rhuke uzɛ̃rhã. <verse eid="REV 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21"/>Use adzipumbɔ ri ifɛre anera, use idzimmbɔ, use amɛn aka atoma-dakmbɔ use ivɛu umbɔ iki ivɛu.<verse eid="REV 9:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Ipfu itser-Num nggu <optbreak/> ungwɛ̃rhũ ubvur uku ufeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã nggaa ipfu itser-Num iyɔɔ ikerketangge, ngge idzeka afã icipuwa. Atsire ngge nggu amɛɛ, nggu ikon inai ni itsingge, asungge awe ru nyaki ishaa unum, adakngge ikɛi awe ru nyaka agban aki urha. <verse eid="REV 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2"/>Akpɔm nggu ungwɛ̃rhũ ubvur uku ufeta, uwuruwi unga aka ayanga akpɔm, udak ughanga unga aden nu ukau ukugɔng, udak ufer nu abĩ. <verse eid="REV 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3"/>Atsarhi irhaknga ikerketangge ayisa ru nyaka akpe utɛ̃rhĩmi. Ivangyɛ unga aka ayisa amaa, írhak iyiki irhirhare ha utɔɔva irherha arherhe. <verse eid="REV 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4"/>Ivang írhak utɔɔva iyiki irhirhare ha iki irherhe, umum ibee itsitsɛng, bɔr umum igũ urhɛm uku urherha arherhe ra afã ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uborhe arherhe irhirhare ha utɔɔva iki irherhe, niba utsɛngo ngge!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5"/>Mɔcɛ ipfu itser-Num hã umum iki inyã ngge idɛ̃ɛ̃ ru ukau ukugɔng nu abĩ hã iberu ubok ughangge ra afã. <verse eid="REV 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6"/>Ni iyirh nggu itsok uwuku ubɛk ugbagbaa, uwuruwi aka amuna afã nu kishoo abinkɛ aka awu ra ake, nu abĩ nu kishoo abinkɛ aka awe ra ake, nu ukau ukugɔng nu kishoo abinkɛ aka awe ru ukpɔ, igɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Ididãrhã ishingge! <verse eid="REV 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7"/>Bɔr ru inum ipfu itser-Num iyi utɔɔva ha iki iwuri ibar utsomngge, ngge iki itsuifɛr ubinkpi Unum aka awɔk ra amɛnnga abee ikorhe, ru nyaka unga aka adɛyiwe agãrhãnga abika asɔm Arherhu-Num.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8"/>Mɔcɛ urhɛm hã umum iki igũ ra afã ubvui urherha arherhe nggu umum ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uzĩ, uyɛi ubvur uku ufeta ha uku uwe ru ubok ipfu itser-Num hã iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ nu ukau ukugɔng nu abĩ hã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9"/>Nggee umum izĩ ri ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr ngge ugɛ udzaa ungwɛ̃rhũ ubvur uku ufeta ha. Ngge igɔr umum igɛ, &lt;&lt;Uyɛi utãi, umgbɔ uwuri iwu uku ukpere ra anango, bɔr ra angwĩngo umgbɔ uwuri iwu uku utoong ru nyaku utoo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10"/>Nggee umum izĩ iyɛi ungwɛ̃rhũ ubvur uku ufeta ha ru ubok ipfu itser-Num hã itãiwe. Umgbɔ uwe uku utoong ugɛɛ utoo ra angwĩmum, bɔr umum iki inguwe, umgbɔ udzipu uwe uku ukpere ra anaamum. <verse eid="REV 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11"/>Mɔcɛ umbɔ adɛyiwa umum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu ufang ungo iki isɔm Arherhu-Num ru anera arhɛrhɛ, nu abĩã arhɛrhɛ, nu idũa irhɛirhɛ, nu ikɛi ra ayɛrhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Abi ideka avaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1"/>Adzaa umum igbong iyiki imei ider nu ikpina, agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uzĩ umei Iya-Num nu ubepa, nu uvarhi irhɛ anera aki idzowe igɔng umɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2"/>Bɔr niba umeisɔ ufɔma, ubinkutsu aka adzowe ukpɔ ra atsen abi Uyahuda. Abirabɛ aka idzowe uver ru usarkasar uteu ha utsɛku afɛ̃ɛ̃ isɔka inaa nu avaa (42). <verse eid="REV 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3"/>Umum iwuri idzowe ijee ru inera ivaa abika adeka umum, umbɔ awuri itsim atorho aki ifakpe na asɔm arherhamum inuma unaku ugɔnga unying nu inaka ivaa nu isɔka utɔ̃ĩ (1,260).&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4"/>Abi ideka avaa ha awu acucii uzaitun hã nu anang idɛ̃ɛ̃ irhirhang hã ikivarhake iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu Uteijee uwu abĩ kishoo. <verse eid="REV 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5"/>Unera aba abeenga inayiwe umbɔ, urha udzeka ra angwĩmbɔ ukpĩĩwe anggamtsakmbɔ. Rimi hã ubɛn unera aka abee inayiwe umbɔ awu ufang unga akpe. <verse eid="REV 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6"/>Anera abɛrɛ awembɔ ri ijee iyiki ifɔme afã utsur inai idoingge ri inumyɛ umbɔ aka idɛ̃ɛ̃ isɔm Arherhu-Num, awembɔ ri ijee iyiki idzipa amɛ̃ ake awe adzirh na atsuke abĩã nggu ubɛn ikpũ ikpo ubɛn ivang umbɔ aka abee.<verse eid="REV 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka amaa ideka ha, ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha iwuri idzek ru ughorkaghor angwĩ aka asheri imimasha ha, iwuri itang iwa nggu umbɔ, ni inangge umbɔ, ni ifɛre umbɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8"/>Ikommbɔ iwuri inũ ru utsĩndĩ nggaa uteu Urusharhima, umbɔ aki iyisa Usɔdɔm nu Umasar, anangkɛ umbɔ aka anyapuwe Uteijeembɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9"/>Inuma itaar nu utenga anera ru ubɛn abĩã, anuisa, idũa, awuri itsu asumbɔ ri ikom hã, na akpɛ̃mbɔ idzak ake. <verse eid="REV 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10"/>Aner upfung awuri igɔmanggɔm ru akpe abi ideka ha ikivarhambɔ, awuri izek irhowa na adzise ízũwã ra adɔka, ubinkutsu uver abika asɔm Arherhu-Num hã ikivarhambɔ aka akũwe upfunga uku umaakpɔ.<verse eid="REV 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11"/>Bɔr inuma itaar nu utenga iki imaa, uwoi ukpuku udzowe urhɛ udzeku Unum uba utsĩ ru umbɔ, umbɔ akata asok adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra adakmbɔ, na abika anyã umbɔ agũ iwei akarhãrhã. <verse eid="REV 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12"/>Mɔcɛ abi ideka ha ikivarhambɔ agũ urhɛm ukerketakpɔ uku udzeka afã urherha arherhe nggu umbɔ ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka afũã nggɛɛ!&gt;&gt; Umbɔ afũmbɔ ra afã ru amɛɛ, na anggamtsakmbɔ azɛrhe izizĩmbɔ.<verse eid="REV 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13"/>Kanying nggaa izizusa izusu abĩ ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra usɔka (1/10) aki uteu ha abupa atsĩke ra abĩ, afɛrke inera anaka agɔnga utɔɔva (7,000). Aner abika abɔr agũ iwei akarhãrhã, akpoi Unum uwu afã.<verse eid="REV 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14"/>Atorh aki uvaa aka atɔngke, bɔr atorh aki untaar asi ídãrhũke na aba.<verse eid="REV 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utsom ukpu utɔɔva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi utɔɔva ibar utsomngge, irhɛm ikerketangge ra afã, igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">&lt;&lt;Ijee iyɛrhe upfunga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">iki iwe iyi Uteijeemɛn nu iyi Ukiristonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">unga awuri igha iyɛrhe ugbagbaa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16"/>Nu akakũ isɔka ivaa na anaa hã aka asei nu anang iseimbɔ ha ra asu Unum, agba anu na adzowe igɔng ru Unum, <verse eid="REV 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17"/>agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">&lt;&lt;Umɛn itar uwɛɛ ru ungo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">Uteijee Unum Uwu Ijee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Uwuruwi aka awe icɛrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">awu unga awe isha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Ubinkutsu ungo uku utirhungo itser nggu ijee iyiki igɔngngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">nu uku utirhungo igha iyɛrhe.<verse eid="REV 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18"/>Abĩã agũ avɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nu avɔmngo aka abake.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ivanga iki iwengge iyiki itsu uvau ra abi akpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">nu udzowe itosa ra agãrhãngo abika asɔm Arherhu-Num</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">nu abika adɔsa nu kishoo abika awe ri iwei ri itsokngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">akagɔng nu akaci.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ivanga iki iwengge umbɔ aka itsĩme</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">abirabɛ aka atsĩme upfunga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19"/>Mɔcɛ Iya-Num ra afã itsuri, ri Iya-Num hã umbɔ aka anyã akɔti ibibemuwenga. Ra anang hã inyĩnyaka irhang, nggaa irhirhare, nu izizusa abĩ nu nggaa atar inai.<verse eid="REV 11:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Utsɛrh uwɔɔ nu ibvui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1"/>Nggaa utsar idzeu udzeka ra afã, utsɛrh uwɔɔ umbɔ aka anyangu ishaa unum atsire unga, nggu ufɛ̃ ru andaidaknga, nu ifur iyɛrhe ídzɛɛr usɔkdũmɛn ni itsinga. <verse eid="REV 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2"/>Utsɛrh ha awu ra anna na ihwashi imar aciu akpe uver imar. <verse eid="REV 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3"/>Mɔcɛ utsar ukpɔɔ udzeka ra afã, nu nggaa ibvui iki ibãrhã nggu atsi utɔɔva, nu atsom usɔka, nu ífur iyɛrhe utɔɔva nu atsingge utɔɔva ha. <verse eid="REV 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4"/>Usĩngge ugbiir ugbɛra unying ra agbɛra ataar (1/3) aki ídzɛr ra afã itare ngge ra abĩ. Ibvui ha idɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu utsɛrh uwuku uhwashi imar, nu ngge ima inguwe ungwɛ̃ utsɛrh ha aka imar. <verse eid="REV 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5"/>Utsɛrh ha amar uwɛkutsa, uwuruwi aka iwu uyɛrhe abĩã kishoo nggu igbong uzɔu. Bɔr umbɔ avur ungwɛ̃nga azĩmbɔ ru Unum ra anang iseinga. <verse eid="REV 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6"/>Utsɛrh ha atĩ azĩã ra arhum ra anang akɔɔ Unum aka agbishuwe unga, umbɔ ama afuka unga inuma unaku ugɔnga unying nu inaka ivaa nu isɔka utɔ̃ĩ (1,260). <figure style="fig" alt="Dragon (red snake) with seven heads" file="gt00152.tif" size="col" loc="12.6" copy="Gordon Thompson" ref="12.3-6">Nggaa ibvui iki ibãrhã nggu atsia utɔɔva</figure><verse eid="REV 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7"/>Mɔcɛ iwa isongge ra afã. Umika'irhu nggu ípfu itser-Num itang iwa nggu ibvui ha, ibvui ha nu ípfu itser-ngge itang ifai. <verse eid="REV 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8"/>Bɔr iwa ighangge ibvui ha, awayiwe ngge idzekngge, akɛnmbɔ ngge anang isei ra afã. <verse eid="REV 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9"/>Nggaa ibvui ha, ibvui iyi isha ha umbɔ iki iyisa ngge Undenggũ, use Ushaitan, aki idzunuwe upfunga kishoo ukpɔ uyapa, umbɔ atare unga igba ra abĩ nggu ípfu itsernga.<verse eid="REV 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10"/>Mɔcɛ umum ĩgũ urhɛm ukerketakpɔ ra afã ugɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">&lt;&lt;Icɛrɛ ififɔrh nu ijee nu Iyɛrhe Unummɛn iki ibangge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">nu ijee Ukiristonga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">Ubinkutsu uner uwuku utsu arherha angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">uner uwuku utsu arherhambɔ ra asu Unum ra atenum nu utsuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">aka atarkumbɔ unga ra abĩ.<verse eid="REV 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11"/>Umbɔ anangmbɔ unga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">ra adzirh Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">nu ijee irhɛm idekambɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">Umbɔ asi ibemumbɔ urhɛmbɔ akarhãrhã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">na abeembɔ idzowe urhɛmbɔ akpe.<verse eid="REV 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12"/>Nggee àka agɔm anggɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">umbi afã nu umbi abika asei umɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Bɔr atorh abĩ nu akau akagɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">ubinkutsu Undenggũ hã aka acipuwanga ru umbi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Unga awu nggu avɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">ubinkutsu unga ahwɛnga ivangnga iwu iki ikpina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13"/>Ivang ibvui ha iki inyã ugɛ aka atare ngge nu abĩ, ngge idɔsu utsɛrh ha aka amar uwɛkutsa ha. <verse eid="REV 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14"/>Bɔr adzowe utsɛrh ha afɛk avaa aki nggaa isew iyiki igɔng, nu unga ama asoka afɛk afafã izĩ ra anangkɛ umbɔ aka agbisha ra arhum, umbɔ aka ifuka unga utsɛku imɛka itaar nu utenga ra anangkɛ ibvui iki isi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ ibangungge unga. <verse eid="REV 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15"/>Mɔcɛ ibvui ha iwupa amɛ̃ ra angwĩngge ru nyaka azɛ̃ ru utsɛrh ha, ibvui ha ibee ikũ azɛ̃ hã idzɛ̃rhã unga. <verse eid="REV 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16"/>Bɔr abĩ ayike utsɛrh ha. Ayanga angwĩke ahwawe amɛ̃ hã ibvui ha iki iwupa ra angwĩngge. <verse eid="REV 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17"/>Mɔcɛ ibvui ha igũ avɔm nggu utsɛrh ha akarhãrhã ni idzek idɛ̃ɛ̃ngge iwa nggu unang utsɛrh ha, kishoo abirabɛ aka adɔsi Íkpem Unum, na akpɔm ideka Uyesu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abvur akɔɔ aki itsɛng abok aki isha agɔrke ikɛi ugɛ, </char><char style="fv">18</char> <char style="fqa" closed="false">Mɔcɛ ibvui ha idɛ̃ɛ̃ngge nú ubang ukau ha.</char></note><verse eid="REV 12:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1"/>Ibvui ha idɛ̃ɛ̃ngge ru ubang ukau ukugɔng hã.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="REV 13:1">Ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha <optbreak/> iki idzeka ru ukau ukugɔng</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 13:1">Ikɛi umum inyã ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe iki idzeka ru ukau ukugɔng hã. Iwu ra atsom usɔka, nu atsia utɔɔva. Ubɛn utsoma uwekpɔ ru ífur iyɛrhe, ikɛi ubɛn itsia iweke ri itsok iki irhenu Unum. <verse eid="REV 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2"/>Ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha umum iki inyã iwu ru nyaki igbĩ, bɔr iwu ru nggaa agbarh itok adedetake, angwĩngge awu ru nyaka aki utɛ̃rhĩmi. Ibvui ha idzowe ikerngge ri ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe hã, nu anang iseingge, nu ijee iyiki igɔng. <verse eid="REV 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3"/>Itsia unying ra atsi ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha iwe ru nggaa usɔɔ, bɔr nggaa usɔɔ ha uku ukerhukpɔ. Upfunga kishoo udzeidzeu nu udɔsukpɔ ijuɛ ha. <verse eid="REV 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4"/>Anera adzowe igɔng ri ibvui ha ubinkutsu ngge iki idzowe ijeengge ri ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe hã, umbɔ ikɛi adzowe igɔng ri ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe hã na arhusa agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungaa awu ru nyaki ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe iyɛrɛ? Ungaa adɛ̃ɛ̃ atang iwa nggu ngge?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5"/>Adzowe ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe hã angwĩ aki irhena ibemi itsi nu irhenu Unum, na adzowe ngge ijee iyiki ikorhu ubinkpi ngge iki ibee afɛ̃ɛ̃ isɔka inaa nu afɛ̃ɛ̃ avaa. <verse eid="REV 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6"/>Ngge iyanga angwĩngge irhenu Unum, ni irhenu itsoknga, nu anangkɛ unga aki isei, nu kishoo abika asei ra afã. <verse eid="REV 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7"/>Adzowe ngge iker, ngge itang iwa nggu abika adɔsa ni inangge umbɔ. Na adzowe ngge ijee ra anuisa, nu anera, idũa, nu abĩã. <verse eid="REV 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8"/>Kishoo anera abika asei ra abĩ awuri idzowe igɔng ru ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha, bɔr abirabɛ udzur ri imimunu upfunga umbɔ aka atsɛng atsokmbɔ ru ubvur urhɛ uwu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha umbɔ aka afɛr, asi ídzowukumbɔ igɔng ru ijuɛ arhum hã.<verse eid="REV 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9"/>Uner ato akika agũ, uneke unga agũ!<verse eid="REV 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10"/>Ubɛn unera aka izĩ igãrhã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">igãrhã unga aka izĩ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Ubɛn unera umbɔ aka ifɛr nggu ikon iki ider,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">akũ ikon iki ider afɛre unga.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Akɛrɛ abee idɔngamɛn ibibima nu imangmang ra abika adɔsa.<verse eid="REV 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha <optbreak/> iki idzeka ra abĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe iyɔɔ, iki idzeka ra abĩ. Iwu ra atsom avaa ru nyaku ungwɛ̃ itsurhi, bɔr irherha arherhe ru nyaki ibvui. <verse eid="REV 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12"/>Ngge ikũ kishoo ijee iyi ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe iyi inggbaashia ni itɔ̃we ngge itser. Ni itsu upfunga nu abika asei umɔ adzowe igɔng ri ijuɛ iyi inggbaashia iyi ha usɔɔngge uku ukerhukpɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13"/>Ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe iyi uvaa ha ikorhe nggaa abin idzeu, utsɛku ngge iki itsu urha udzeka afã acipuwa ra abĩ ra asu anera. <verse eid="REV 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14"/>Ngge irhɛm anera kishoo aka asei ra abĩ ri itsi atsar idzeu ha umbɔ aka adzowe ngge ijee ru ubok ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe iyi inggbaashi ha. Ngge itsú umbɔ adzin usaka ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe iyi inggbaashi ha adzowe ngge igɔng, iyi ha umbɔ aka akũ ikon iki ider anayiwe ngge, ngge inang ibɛk. <verse eid="REV 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15"/>Adzowe ijuɛ iyɛrɛ iyi ivaa ha ngge idzowe uwoi ukpu urhɛ ru usaka ijuɛ hã iyi inggbaashia. Ngge ítsu usaka ha udɛ̃ɛ̃ urherha arherhe, ni ifɛre kishoo abirabɛ aka akpɛ̃mbɔ idzowe ngge igɔng. <verse eid="REV 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16"/>Itsu ubɛn unera inggang, akagɔng nu aka aci, abi ubin nu atsũwã, ateiya nu agãrhã, atsɛnge umbɔ idzɛu ra abokmbɔ use ra ashimbɔ. <verse eid="REV 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17"/>Ngge itsú unera asi ígosha use agoshuka ubin, unga aba ashia ri idzɛungge, iyi ha iki iwe itsok ijuɛ ha use utsar itsokngge.<verse eid="REV 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18"/>Akɛrɛ ha abee itsoi. Ubɛn unera aba awea ri ihwihwɛng awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ akũ agben utsar ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha adzekanga. Ubinkutsu utsar ha udɛ̃ɛ̃ ri itsok unera. Utsar ha uwu anaka utɔ̃ĩ nu isɔka utɔ̃ĩ nu utɔ̃ĩ (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha <optbreak/> nu anaka agɔnga unaka unying <optbreak/> nu anaka agɔnga isɔka inaa <optbreak/> nu anaka agɔnga annaa (144,000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1"/>Mɔcɛ umum iki irhi, umum inyã Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha, iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ ni itsi Igũ Usihiyona nu aner ha anaka agɔnga unaka unying nu anaka agɔnga isɔka inaa nu anaka agɔnga annaa (144,000) nggu itsok Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi nu iki Utɛ aka atsɛng nu ashimbɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2"/>Umum igũ irhak iyɔɔ ra afã irhaka ugɛɛ arhɛrha amɛ̃ iki idzɛ̃rhã, ru nyaku nggaa irhirhare inai. Irhak ha umum iki igũ irhakngge iwu ugɛɛ abar igbɔm. <verse eid="REV 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3"/>Atsũ ubom uku ufa ukpɔɔ ra asu anang isei ha, ra asu imimuna abin hã ikinanake aki urhɛ, nu ra asu akakũ hã. Unera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ amesunga ubom hã, inera anaka agɔnga unaka unying nu anaka agɔnga isɔka inaa nu anaka agɔnga annaa hã (144,000) ukpekũ, abirabɛ aka akpo ififai ra abĩ. <verse eid="REV 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4"/>Abi ha abɛ aka anasi itsĩmbɔ ra arhim akatsɛrh, umbɔ atsu atsimbɔ asasar. Umbɔ adɔsu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha atsĩ ubɛn anang unga aka azĩ. Abɛrɛ ha umbɔ afai umbɔ ru anera umbɔ awu ru nyaki ikpũrhã abin irham akirakɛ aka agbaashia akɔ̃ umbɔ aka idzowe ru Unum nu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha. <verse eid="REV 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5"/>Asi igũmbɔ igbɛrangwĩ ra angwĩmbɔ, umbɔ ashimbɔ ru uvau.<verse eid="REV 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ípfu itser-Num itaar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã ipfu itser-Num iki itĩ afafã, ikpɔm nggu Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyi ugbagbaa idɛyiwe anera aka asei nu abĩ uzĩ ubɛn abĩã, unuisa, idũa nu anera. <verse eid="REV 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7"/>Ngge itsarhi irhakngge ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka agũ iwei Unum na akpoi itsoknga, ubinkutsu ivang iyiki izharha arherhanga iki ibangge. Àka adzowe unga igɔng unga uwuku umuna afã, nu abĩ, nu akau akagɔng, nu akwiu amɛ̃!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi uvaa idɔsa ni igɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubabirha ukugɔng, uku ugbakpɔ, uku ugbakpɔ, ukpuku utsu abĩã kishoo afĩrhã nggu amɛ̃ inebi akatãrhã amɛn itoma-dak!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi untaar idɔsa umbɔ ni itsarhi irhakngge igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubɛn unera aba adzowuka igɔng ru ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha nu usakangge na ayɛisa idzɛu ni ishinga use uboknga, <verse eid="REV 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10"/>unga iganga, awuri ihwa amɛ̃ inebi avɔm Unum akirakɛ umbɔ aka akũ ikernga kishoo agbisha ru ukpɛwa avɔm Unum. Awuri idzowe uver ru unga ru urha, nu urha uku uterha, ra asu asarkasar ípfu itser-Num ra asu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha. <verse eid="REV 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11"/>Azoo urhambɔ aki uver adɛ̃ɛ̃ isisoyi ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa. Iwiwosha ishingge ra abirabɛ aka adzowe igɔng ri ijuɛ ha nu usakangge na ayɛi idzɛu itsokngge ru untsuu nu atenum.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12"/>Akɛrɛ abee idɔngamɛn ibibima ru abika adɔsu Íkpem Unum na awe ru imangmang ru Uyesu.<verse eid="REV 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13"/>Mɔcɛ umum igũ urhɛm uku udzeka afã ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsɛng, idorh iwu iyi abirabɛ aka akpe ru Uteijee udzur icɛrɛ uzĩɔ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Ipfu-Num igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, umbɔ awuri iwoshumbɔ ri itsermbɔ, ubinkutsu itosi itsermbɔ idɔsa umbɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Igbɛr abin aki abĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14"/>Umum irhi, umum inyã amɛɛ akaterha, nu uwɔɔ ugɛɛ Ungwɛ̃-Ner<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Udan 7.13</ref></char>.</note> aka asei ra amɛɛ ha, awu nggu ifur iyɛrhe uzinarhi ni itsinga, akpɔm nggu ikon ighaigharake ru uboknga. <verse eid="REV 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15"/>Mɔcɛ ipfu itser-Num iyɔɔ idzek ri Iya-Num itsarhi irhakngge iyisu uwu ha aka asei ru amɛɛ ha igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ukũ ikonngo ugbɛr, ubinkutsu ivang igbɛr abin iki iwengge, abin abĩ aka akɔ̃ke.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16"/>Nggee uwu ha aka asei ru amɛɛ ha atare ikonnga nu abĩ, umbɔ akũ agbɛr abin abĩ.<verse eid="REV 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyɔɔ idzeki Iya-Num ra afã, ngge igangge iwengge ri ikon ighaigharake. <verse eid="REV 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18"/>Ikɛi ipfu itser-Num iyɔɔ, iyiriyɛ iki idzɛu urha ubeu idzeka ru ubeu ha itsarhi irhakngge iyisu ipfu itser-Num iyiki ikpɔm ikon hã, igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ukũ ikonngo ugbɛr inebi ra abĩã, ubinkutsu ikpũrhãngge iki ikɔ̃ngge.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19"/>Ipfu itser-Num hã itare ikonngge nu abĩã, ngge igbɛr ikpũrhũ inebi ni utsuke ru nggaa ughwee ukpuku upayi amɛ̃ inebi aki avɔm Unum. <verse eid="REV 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20"/>Umbɔ anu ipayi umbɔ ru unɔrkang nggaa ughwee ukpuku upayi amɛ̃ inebi ru undzing utepa. Adzirh atengasha adzek afũrhã afafã iderngge itsĩngge angwĩ inyãwã itɛisa itsĩngge akirhomita anaka ataar (300 km).<verse eid="REV 14:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Ípfu itser-Num utɔɔva <optbreak/> nu íkpo utɔɔva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1"/>Umum inyã nggaa utsar ukpɔɔ ra afã ugɔgɔngakpɔ, ípfu itser-Num utɔɔva nu íkpo utɔɔva iyiki imimasha, ubinkutsu ngge iwuri idɛyiwe avɔm Unum akika amumasha. <verse eid="REV 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2"/>Umum inyã ubin ukpɔɔ uku uwe ugɛɛ ukau ukugɔng umbɔ aka agbisha ukpɔ nggu irhi ukayi nggu urha. Awu abirabɛ aka anangmbɔ ijuɛ hã, nu usaka ha, nu atsar itsok ha, umbɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ akhapa ru ukau ukugɔng. Akpɔm nggu igbɔm Unum aka adzowe umbɔ. <verse eid="REV 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3"/>Atsũ ubom Umusa ugãrhũ Unum nu ubom Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">&lt;&lt;A Uyɛrhe undanna kishoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Itserngo iwu idzeu igɔigɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Uteijee Unum Uwu Ijee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Ikɛi, atsĩndĩngo awu akika arhurhika aki idzidzɛrhe.<verse eid="REV 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4"/>Ungaa asi ígũa iweingo, A Uteijee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">na akpoi itsokngo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ungo ikiyikango uwu usasar.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Abĩã kishoo awuri iba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">na adzaa ungo igɔng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">ubinkutsu itser irhirhikango iki idzekangge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5"/>Akɛrɛ aka amaa, umum inyã ra afã Iya-Num, iki iwu Utsurha-Num udɛ̃ɛ̃ iyɛm. <verse eid="REV 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6"/>Ri Iya-Num hã ípfu itser-Num utɔɔva iki idzeka nggu íkpo utɔɔva. Atsim atorho urhini atɛtɛnake na arhang, abow nggu ayim uzinarhi ri ikɔkmbɔ. <verse eid="REV 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7"/>Mɔcɛ unying ri imimuna abin ha aki urhɛ ha ikinanake adzowe ípfu itser-Num utɔɔva ha itɛ̃rhã azɔu uzinarhi utɔɔva atɔk nggu avɔm Unum, unga aka abɛk ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="REV 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8"/>Umɔ azoo adzeki ikpikpoi Unum nu ijeenga atɔke Iya-Num hã. Unera asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ atsĩã ri Iya-Num hã utsɛku íkpo ha utɔɔva iyi ípfu itser-Num hã iki imaa.<verse eid="REV 15:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Atɛ̃rhĩ utɔɔva aki avɔm Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1"/>Mɔcɛ umum igũ urhɛm ukpɔɔ ukeker uku urherha arherhe ri Iya-Num hã udɛyiwe ípfu itser-Num hã utɔɔva ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka akũ atɛ̃rhã akɛrɛ utɔɔva aki avɔm Unum azĩ awupuwe nu abĩ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi inggbaashia izĩ iwupuwe ubinkpi uku uwe ri itɛ̃rhĩ ake ra abĩ, isɔɔ inor iyiki ibewe idzeyiwa ra ayor aner ha aka awu ri idzɛu ijuɛ ha na adzowe igɔng ru usakangge.<verse eid="REV 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi uvaa iwupuwe ubinkpi uku uwe ri itɛ̃rhĩ ake ru ukau ukugɔng, amɛ̃ adzipa awe adzirh ru nyaku unerwi aka akpea, nu ubɛn imimuna abin urhɛ aka awu ru ukau ha akpeke.<verse eid="REV 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi untaar iwupuwe ubinkpi uku uwe ri itɛ̃rhĩ ake ra azɛ̃ nu akwiu amɛ̃, ake adzipa awe adzirh. <verse eid="REV 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5"/>Mɔcɛ umum igũ ipfu itser-Numyɛ amɛ̃ aka awe ru ubokngge iki igɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">&lt;&lt;Ungo urhika ri itsu uvaungo hã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">Usarkasar uwuku urhika ha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">ungo uku uwe icɛrɛ, nu uwe isha.<verse eid="REV 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6"/>Ubinkutsu umbɔ afɛre abika adɔsa ungo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">nu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:6">nggayɛ icɛ ungo udzowe umbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">inyã ayer umbɔ ahwa ubin uku umɛ̃ɛ̃ ru umbɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7"/>Umum igũ urhɛm uku udzeku ubeu ha ubema ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">&lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, Uteijee Unum Uwu Ijee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">izharha arherhango iwu idzidzɛrhe ni irhika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi unaa iwupuwe ubinkpi uku uwe ri itɛ̃rhĩ ake ri ishaa unum, na adzowe ishaa unum ijee ngge ikpĩĩwe anera nggu urha. <verse eid="REV 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9"/>Imani unum hã inũ ikpĩĩ anera, utsɛku umbɔ aka arheni itsok Unum, uwuruwi aka awu ri ijee ni itsi íkpo ha, bɔr akpɛ̃mbɔ idzipa akpoi igɔngnga.<verse eid="REV 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi untɔ̃ɔ̃ iwupuwe ubinkpi uku uwe ri itɛ̃rhĩ ake nu anang isei ijuɛ hã, ikpo uzĩ utsirkpɔ iyɛrhe ijuɛ ha, anera ashang arhɛmmbɔ ru uver. <verse eid="REV 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11"/>Arhenu Unum uwu afã ubinkutsu uvermbɔ ukpu isɔɔ inormbɔ, bɔr umbɔ akpɛ̃mbɔ idzipa ra abinkɛ umbɔ aka akorhe.<verse eid="REV 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi utɔ̃ĩ iwupuwe ubinkpi uku uwe ri itɛ̃rhĩ ake ru nggaa azɛ̃ Uyuferiti, azɛ̃ hã akoyike, umbɔ agbishuwe utsĩndĩ ra ayɛrhe aka idzek udiki igɔ̃kpee aba itang iwa. <verse eid="REV 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã ípfu iyiki ibewe itaar iki iwe ru nyaka aghwerh adzeka ra angwĩ ibvui ha, ni idzeka ra angwĩ ijuɛ hã, ikɛi idzeka ra angwĩ uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num igbɛrangwĩ. <verse eid="REV 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14"/>Ípfu iyiki ibewa ha iwu ípfuyɛ iki ikorhe nggaa atsar idzeu, ngge idzek izĩngge ra ayɛrhe upfunga kishoo, ikɔng umbɔ itang iwa ru nggaa unum hã ukpu Unum Uwu Ijee.<verse eid="REV 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15"/>&lt;&lt;Àka anyã, umum iba ru nyaku uvɛu! Idorh iwe iyi unerwi aka asei adzɛu na atsim atorhanga, utsur unga azĩã igbĩrhĩ na agũã atsak ra ateu anera.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16"/>Mɔcɛ ípfu iyiki ibewe ha ikɔng ayɛrhe ha ananga unying ra anangkɛ umbɔ iki iyisa ugɛ Uarmagedon ri idũ abi Uyahuda.<verse eid="REV 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17"/>Ipfu itser-Num iyi utɔɔva iwupuwe ubinkpi uku uwe ri itɛ̃rhĩ ake ru ugba afafã, urhɛm ukpɔɔ ukeker udzek ra anang isei ha ri Iya-Num, ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Iki imaangge!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18"/>Mɔcɛ irhirhang inyaka, nu irhak, nu irhirhare, nu nggaa izizusa abĩ, iyiki ibeweyɛ iki inasi ikorhungge udzur ri imimunu unera ru upfunga, iwu nggaa izizusa abĩ akarhãrhã. <verse eid="REV 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19"/>Nggaa uteu ha ugasha agbɛra ataar, iteu iki igɔng ra abĩã kishoo itsĩmngge. Unum ayitu nggaa uteu Ubabirha, atsu ukpɔ uhwa ukpɛwa avɔmnga aka atsoo kishoo. <verse eid="REV 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20"/>Ubɛn umpfũwã usitumgbɔ, ígũ ikɛi irhusa inungge. <verse eid="REV 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21"/>Nggaa atar inai imorke iki iwe akirhograma isɔka itɔ̃ɔ̃, idzeka afã igbei nu atsi anera. Anera arhenu Unum ri ikpo atarh inai ha, ubinkutsu ikpo ha ibewungge.<verse eid="REV 16:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Ukutsɛrh nu ijuɛ hã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1"/>Unying ri ípfu itser-Num utɔɔva ha iyiki ikpɔm atɛ̃rhãzɔu utɔɔva ha iba igɔr umum igɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba, umum idɛyiwa ungo itsu uvau uwi umbɔ aka itsuke nggaa unggoyi utsɛrh uwurɛ, unga aka asei ra amɛ̃ arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="REV 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2"/>Ayɛrhe upfunga atoma-dak nggu unga nu anera ru upfung ikɛi itoma-dakmbɔ nggu unga itsu umbɔ afĩrhã ru nyaka afĩrhã adɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3"/>Mɔcɛ ipfu itser-Num hã ikũna umum ri Ipfu-Num izĩngge ra arhum. Umɔ umum inyã ukutsɛrh aka asei ni ijuɛ iyiki ibãrhã iki iwe ra atsok akika arhenu Unum aka atsɛng ri iyorngge, ikɛi iwe ra atsi utɔɔva nu atsom usɔka. <verse eid="REV 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4"/>Utsɛrh ha atsim abin aka abãrhã, nu ikɛi agbɛr idzam nggu uzinarhi, nu ikpũ amasarha akika awu ru ugarh. Akpɔm nggu ukpɛwa uzinarhi atɔk nggu abin ishĩ nu iyiki ibewe iyi itoma-daknga. <verse eid="REV 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5"/>Ni ishinga umbɔ atsɛng itsok iyɛ agbena aka awe iwiwɔk agɛ,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">NGGAA UBABIRHA,</char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">UYI ANGGOYI AKATSƐRH KISHOO,</char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">NU UWU ABIN ISHĨ UPFUNGA. </char><verse eid="REV 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6"/>Umum inyã utsɛrh ha aka afĩrhũnga nggu adzirh abika adɔsa, adzirh abirabɛ umbɔ aka afɛre ri idekuwe Uyesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Ivangyɛ umum iki inyã unga, umum idzedzeu akarhãrhã. <verse eid="REV 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7"/>Mɔcɛ ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr umum igɛ, &lt;&lt;Awu use utsu ungo udzeidzeu? Umum iwuri idɛyiwamum iwiwɔk agben utsɛrh uwurɛ nu aki ijuɛ hã unga aka afũ, iyiki iwu ra atsia utɔɔva nu atsom usɔka. <verse eid="REV 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8"/>Ijuɛ ha ungo uku unyã, iwengge isha, bɔr icɛrɛ ngge ishingge, ngge iwuri ipfudzeka ra angwĩ aka aghor ha izĩ ra anangkɛ umbɔ aka itsĩme ngge. Anera abika asei ru upfung, abirabɛ atsokmbɔ aka ashike ru ubvur urhɛ udzur ri imimunu upfung, awuri idzedzeu ivangyɛ umbɔ aka inyã ijuɛ ha, ubinkutsu ngge iwengge isha, icɛrɛ ngge ishingge, ngge ibvui ibangge.<verse eid="REV 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9"/>&lt;&lt;Abin akɛrɛ ayisa umɛn nggu itsoi. Atsi utɔɔva ha awu igũ utɔɔva aki utsɛrh ha aka asei. <verse eid="REV 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10"/>Ake ikɛi awe ayɛrhe utɔɔva. Abirabɛ atɔ̃ɔ̃ ru ayɛrhe ha aka akpembɔ, unying awu umɔ, unying anasi ibanga kata. Unga aba abanga, awu ufang unga awuri iwe uyɛrhe ivanga ukunjiir. <verse eid="REV 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11"/>Ijuɛ iyiki iwu ru urhɛ isha, ni ishingge icɛrɛ, ngge iwu uyɛrhe uwu utɔrɔk. Ngge iwe ru utɔɔva ha iki idzeka, ngge izĩ ra anangkɛ ngge iki ikpe.<verse eid="REV 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12"/>&lt;&lt;Atsom hã usɔka ungo uku unyã, awu ayɛrhe usɔka aka anasi iyɛimbɔ ijee iyɛrhe kata, bɔr umbɔ awuri iyɛi ijee iyɛrhe iyi ukara unying nggu ijuɛ ha. <verse eid="REV 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13"/>Amɛnmbɔ awe unying na awuri idzowe ijuɛ ha ijeembɔ nu iyɛrhambɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14"/>Awuri itangmbɔ iwa nggu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha, Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha awuri inanga umbɔ, ubinkutsu unga awu Uteijee ateijee nu Uyɛrhe ayɛrhe. Nggu unga awu abirabɛ aka adɔsa unga, unga aka ayisa na asɛng, umbɔ awe abi imangmang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15"/>Mɔcɛ ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr umum igɛ, &lt;&lt;Amɛ̃ hã ungo uku unyã aka awu anang isei unggoyi utsɛrh ha, awu ikpũ anera, nu ikikɔng irhɛirhɛ, nu abĩã nu idũa. <verse eid="REV 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16"/>Atsom hã usɔka ungo uku unyã nu ijuɛ ha awuri ikpɛ̃mbɔ inyã unggoyi utsɛrh ha. Awuri igarhuwe ubinkpi unga aka awu ra ukpɔ na abɔre unga igbĩrhĩ, awuri itãiwe ijuɛ iyornga, na akpĩĩwe unga nggu urha. <verse eid="REV 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17"/>Ubinkutsu Unum atsu umbɔ atɔ̃ itseryɛ amɛnnga aka abee, ra amɛn unying umbɔ abemi idzowe ijuɛ ha ijee iyɛrhambɔ utsɛku Arherhu-Num aka itsuafɛr. <verse eid="REV 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18"/>Utsɛrh ha ungo uku unyã unga awu nggaa uteu ha, unga agha iyɛrhe ra ayɛrhe abĩã.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Itsitsĩm uteu Ubabirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1"/>Akɛrɛ aka amaa umum inyã ipfu itser-Num iyɔɔ iki idzeka afã icipuwa. Iwu nggu nggaa ijee, ikɛi izengge irhange abĩã. <verse eid="REV 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2"/>Itsarhi irhakngge itsui ivum igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">&lt;&lt;Ubabirha ukugɔng, uku ugbakpɔ, uku ugbakpɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Ukpɔ uku uwu anang isei ípfu iyiki ibewe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">nu anang awoyambɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">nu ununu uwuku ubewe, uwu ishĩ.<verse eid="REV 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3"/>Ubinkutsu kishoo abĩã aka ahwambɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">amɛ̃ inebi akatãrhã aki itoma-daknga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">Ayɛrhe abĩã ikɛi atomumbɔ-dak nggu unga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">awɛ izɛɛ abĩã awe abi ubin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">ri ikponi iyiki ibewanga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4"/>Mɔcɛ umum igũ urhɛm ukpɔɔ uku udzeka afã ugɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">&lt;&lt;Àka apfudzeka ru unga umbi anermum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">nggee utsur arhimnga agarke umbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">nggee utsur umbi ayɛimbi ikponga.<verse eid="REV 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5"/>Ubinkutsu ivɔ̃ arhimnga iki itsĩke ra afã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">Unum aka ayitunga iyiki ibewanga.<verse eid="REV 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6"/>Àka abvui adzowe unga ru nyaka unga aka adzaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">ubinkpi unga aka adzowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">àka afase idiki ivaa ubinkpi unga aka akorhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Ru ukpɛwawi unga aka adaka amɛ̃ inebi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">umgbɔ ha umbi aka ikũ adaka idikunga ivaa.<verse eid="REV 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7"/>Àka adzowe unga uver</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ru nyaki ikpikpoi ni igũibɛnyɛ unga aka adzowe itsinga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Ra amɛnnga, unga aka isaka afĩrhã agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">&lt;Umum isei isei iyɛrhe ukutsɛrh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">umum isi iwemum utsɛ̃rhãpfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">umum isi íseisũ ifakpe!&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8"/>Nggee ru unuma unying umbɔ awuri ikwɛr unga nggu ikpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">akpe, ifakpe, nu imerh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Awuri ikpĩĩwe unga nggu urha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ubinkutsu Uteijee Unum uwuku utsu uvau unga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">awu nggaa uner ijee.<verse eid="REV 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9"/>&lt;&lt;Ivangyɛ ayɛrhe abĩã aka atoma-dak nggu unga na agashi igũibɛn, umbɔ aba inyãmbɔ azoo ikpikpĩĩanga, umbɔ awuri idɔng na aciu akpenga. <verse eid="REV 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10"/>Iwei itsu umbɔ adɛ̃ɛ̃ ukuka ru ayetnumnga, awuri idɛ̃ɛ̃ ukuka na aciu agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;Atorh! Atorh, nggaa uteu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Ubabirha, uteu ijee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Ri ivanga unying umbɔ aka atsuka ungo uvau!&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11"/>&lt;&lt;Awɛ izɛɛ abĩã ikɛi aciu akpe na agũ ighongnga, ubinkutsu, unera asi igosha abinmbɔ ikɛi. <verse eid="REV 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12"/>Unera asi igosha uzinarhimbɔ, nu uazurhfambɔ, nu ikpũ amasarhambɔ akika awu ru ugarh, nu uzeze atorho umbɔ aki iyisa urhini nu usirhiki, nu akika awu aka abãrhã, nu ikpũ acucii isung, nu arhɛrhɛ abin aki anyĩ ini, nu acuciiakɛ umbɔ aka atsɛ̃ aki uhwɛk, nu abin azɔu aka abãrhã, nu abin azɔu, nu abin atarh aka aze, <verse eid="REV 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13"/>nu ikpũ abin akɔɔ aki ibɔ̃ɔ̃, nu atsei umbɔ aki iyisa umur nu ufirankisen, nu amɛ̃ inebi, nu atsei uzaitun, nu akɔ̃ itsem, nu ínak, nu ídɔi, nu ínyãwã, nu íkar inyãwã, nu igãrhã ngge iki iwe ípfu anera.<verse eid="REV 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14"/>&lt;&lt;Awɛ izɛɛ agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;Kishoo abin aka aze iyi ha ungo uku utsu amɛnngo iki igwirngge ru ungo. Kishoo abin akika arhang akika awu ru ugarh aka agwirke, ungo usi íbvui ukpoɔ!&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15"/>Awɛ izɛɛ aki ikpo ubin ri izɛɛmbɔ nggu unga, adɛ̃ɛ̃ ukuka, awuri igũ iwei ayetnumnga. Aciu akpe na adɔng, <verse eid="REV 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16"/>awuri iciu akpe agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">&lt;&lt; &lt;Atorh! Atorh, oka nggaa uteu ha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">ukpurukpi uku itsim uzeze atorho umbɔ aki iyisa urhini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">nu ikɛi atorho aka abãrhã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">ikɛi na agbɛr idzam nggu uzinarhi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">nu ikpũ atarh akika awu ru ugarh!<verse eid="REV 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17"/>Ri ivanga unying kishoo nggaa abin akɛrɛ atsĩmke!&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">&lt;&lt;Ubɛn abi ukhukhɔɔ akau akagɔng nu abika atsutsĩa nu abika akpayinga nu kishoo abika atɔ̃ itsermbɔ ra akau akagɔng, adɛ̃ɛ̃ ukuka. <verse eid="REV 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka anyã azoo urha ukpuku ukpĩĩwe uteu ha, agɔr agɛ, &lt;Uteu ukpɔɔ uwekpɔ ru nyaku uteu ukpirɛ?&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19"/>Umbɔ atsuyi uzurhu nu atsimbɔ na aciu akpe, amɛnmbɔ aghong, atsuyi ivum agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">&lt;&lt; &lt;Atorh! Atorh, oka nggaa uteu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Uteukpi abi nggaa ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ kishoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">iki ikpo ubin ra abinkpɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Bɔr ivanga unying ukpɔ utsĩmkpɔ!<verse eid="REV 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20"/>Àka agɔm anggɔm ru ukpɔ umbi afã!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Àka agɔm anggɔm, umbi abika adɔsa nu abi itser Uyesu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">nu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Unum atsu uvau ru ukpɔ ru nyaka ukpɔ uku uyɔm umbi!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21"/>Mɔcɛ nggaa ipfu itser-Num iyɔɔ ikerketangge inyãngu nggaa utarh ukpɔɔ ru nyaku nggaa ukɔ igɔ, itare ru ukau ukugɔng, igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">&lt;&lt;Nggu nggaa avɔm riminɛ umbɔ aka itare Ubabirha nggaa uteu ha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">asi íbvui akpombɔ ukpɔ.<verse eid="REV 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22"/>Umbɔ asi íbvui agũmbɔ ibar igbɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">nu abika atsusa ambom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">ibar userhwa nu ibar atsom ru ungo ikɛi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Asi íbvui anyãmbɔ abi itser abok umɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">asi íbvui agũmbɔ irhak igɔ ru ungo ikɛi.<verse eid="REV 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23"/>Irhirhang usi íbvui irhangngge ru ungo ikɛi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Asi íbvui agũmbɔ urhɛm utsa uku ufa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">use utsɛrh uku ufa ru ungo ikɛi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Ubinkutsu isha awɛ izɛɛngo umbɔ awe ru ijee ru upfunga kishoo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">Ikɛi ungo urhɛm abĩã kishoo nggu itser igokango!<verse eid="REV 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24"/>Ru atsĩndĩngo umbɔ aka akpo adzirh abika asɔm Arherhu-Num</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">nu aki abika adɔsa ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">nu abɔɔ umbɔ aka afɛr ru upfunga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Akpoi Unum ra afã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1"/>Akɛrɛ aka amaa umum igũ abin akɔɔ irhak ake ikeker ugɛɛ nggaa ikikɔng ra afã atsu ivum agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">&lt;&lt;Ukpoi Unum!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Ififɔrh, nu igɔng, nu ijee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:1">iwu iyi Unummɛn.<verse eid="REV 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2"/>Ubinkutsu izharha arherhanga iwe idzidzɛrhe ni irhika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Unga aka atsĩme nggaa unggoyi utsɛrh ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">aka adakuwe abĩã nggu itoma-daknga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Unga utsuke ufai ru utsɛrh ha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">ri ifɛre agãrhã Unum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3"/>Ikɛi umbɔ abvui atsu ivum agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">&lt;&lt;Ukpoi Unum!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">Azookɛ iki idzeyiwa ru unga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:3">awuri ifũrhã afafã ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4"/>Akakũ isɔka ivaa na anaa hã nggu imimuna abin urhɛ ha ikinanake agba anu na adzowe igɔng ru Unum, uwuku usei nu anang isei ha. Aciu agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">&lt;&lt;Iwerimi! Ukpoi Unum!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5"/>Mɔcɛ urhɛm udzek ra anang isei ha ugɔr ugɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">&lt;&lt;Àka akpoi Unummɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">kishoo umbi agãrhãnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">umbi abika agũ iwei unga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">abika agɔng nu abika aci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6"/>Mɔcɛ umum igũ irhak ru nyaki ikikɔng iyiki igɔng, ru nyaka amɛ̃ azɛ̃ akagɔng aki itĩ, ru nyaku nggaa irhirhare inai, itsu ivum agɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">&lt;&lt;Ukpoi Unum!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">Ubinkutsu Uteijee Unum Uner Ijee awu Uyɛrhe.<verse eid="REV 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7"/>Umɛn igɔmanggɔm ni igũibɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">ni ikpoi unga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Ubinkutsu ipfunu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi iki iwengge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">nu utsɛrh uwuku ufanga aka agbisha amaanga.<verse eid="REV 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8"/>Uzeze atorho umbɔ aki iyisa urhini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">aka aterha atɛtɛnake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">umbɔ aka adzowe unga atsim.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:8">Uzeze atorho ha ake awu itser irhirhika iyi abika adɔsa.<verse eid="REV 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9"/>Mɔcɛ ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr umum igɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsɛng, &lt;Idorh iwe iyi abirabɛ umbɔ aka aghwi umbɔ izĩ ipfuna Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha!&gt; &gt;&gt; Ngge itoma igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Akɛrɛ ake awe Arherhu-Num aki idzidzɛrhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10"/>Mɔcɛ umum igba inũ ra adaknga idzowe unga igɔng, bɔr unga agɔr umum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba ukorhungo rimi! Umum iwu undɔki itser ru ungo nu angwɛ̃mbi nggu anapumbi, abirabɛ aka akpɔm ideka Uyesu. Udzowe igɔng ru Unum! Ubinkutsu ideku Uyesu ngge idzowe ijee iyiki isɔm Arherhu-Num.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwɔɔ nu inyãwã iyiki iterha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11"/>Umum inyã afã adɛ̃ɛ̃ iyɛm umum inyã inyãwã iyiki iterha itsok uwuku ufũ ngge igburh Uner Imangmang nu Uner Idzidzɛrhe. Nggu irhirhika unga aka atsu uvau na itang iwa. <verse eid="REV 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12"/>Ishaa asunga iwu ru nyaki ikon urha, ífur iyɛrhe iwu irhɛirhɛ ni itsinga. Ikɛi awea ri itsok iki itsɛng, unera asi ihwɛnga bɔr unga ikiyikanga ahwɛng. <verse eid="REV 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13"/>Atsim atorho akagɔng aka abii ra adzirh, itsoknga igburh, Urhɛm Unum. <verse eid="REV 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14"/>Ukpui abi iwa ra afã udɔsa unga, atsim azeze atorho umbɔ aki iyisa urhini akaterha na awu atɛtɛnake, afũ inyãwã iyiki iterha. <verse eid="REV 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15"/>Ra angwĩnga ikon iki ider ikɔɔ ighaigharake unga aka akũ azharha abĩã agba. Unga awuri ikũ igbong uzɔu awe Uyɛrhambɔ. Unga awuri ipayi ru nggaa ughwee ukpuku upayi amɛ̃ inebi aki uver avɔm Unum uwu ijee kishoo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Amb 2.9</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="REV 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16"/>Nu atorha akagɔnga nu ijeng adaknga umbɔ atsɛng itsoknga agɛ,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 19:16">
    <char style="sc">&lt;&lt;UYƐRHE AYƐRHE NU UTEIJEE ATEIJEE.&gt;&gt;</char><verse eid="REV 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17"/>Ni inyã ipfu itser-Num iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ ri ishaa unum, itsarhi irhakngge iyisa anunu kishoo aka atĩna ra afafã agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka aba akɔng ra anang nggaa irhowa iyi Unum. <verse eid="REV 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18"/>Ngge itsú umbi atãiwe ijuɛ ayɛrha, nu iyi anggbaashi abi iwa, nu iyi aner abika aker, nu iyi inyãwã, nu iyi abika afũrhã ngge, nu ikɛi ijuɛ anera kishoo, agãrhã nu abika afɔn, nu abika agɔng nu abika aci!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe hã nu ayɛrhe abĩã nu abi iwa umbɔ aka akɔng, abee itang iwa nggu uwu ha aka asei nu inyãwã hã, unga nu abi iwanga. <verse eid="REV 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20"/>Bɔr umbɔ adzur ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha nggu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num igbɛrangwĩ abirabɛ aka akorhuwe ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe hã nggaa atsar abin idzeu. Akũ abin idzeu ha arhɛm abika awe ru idzɛu ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe hã, nu abirabɛ aka adzowe igɔng ru usaka ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe hã. Umbɔ adzur ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe hã nggu uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num igbɛrangwĩ na atsuke umbɔ ru ukau urha uku uterha. <verse eid="REV 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21"/>Afɛre abi iwambɔ kishoo nggu ikon iki ider iki idzeka angwĩ uwu ha aka asei ni inyãwã hã, anunu kishoo atãiwe ijuɛ iyormbɔ utsɛku ake iki ishur akarhãrhã.<verse eid="REV 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Imɛka unaku ugɔnga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1"/>Umum inyã ipfu itser-Num iki idzeka afã icipuwa, ikpɔm nggu atsak umukurhi ughorkaghor angwĩ hã nu nggaa inyãwã ru ubokngge. <verse eid="REV 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2"/>Ngge idzur ibvui ha, ibvui iyi isha ha iyiriyɛ iki iwu Undenggũ use Ushaitan, abow ngge nggu inyãwã imɛka unaku ugɔnga. <verse eid="REV 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3"/>Ipfu itser-Num hã itare ngge ra angwĩ aka aghor ha na agbanguka angwĩã na aborhuka ngge, utsur ngge ibvui irhɛmngge abĩã, utsɛku imɛka unaku ugɔng hã utɔng. Akɛrɛ aka imaa, awu ufang umbɔ atsũwe ngge ivanga ukunjiir.<verse eid="REV 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4"/>Ivang hã niyɔ umum inyã anang isei arhɛrhɛ, aki abirabɛ umbɔ aka adzowe umbɔ ijee ivarha arherhe, umbɔ asei umɔ. Ikɛi umum inyã ipfu abirabɛ umbɔ aka azharhuwe atsimbɔ ri idzowe ideku Uyesu nu Arherhu-Num. Awu umbɔ aka asi idzowukumbɔ igɔng ri ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha use usakangge, ikɛi asi iyɛimbɔ idzɛu ukpu ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe hã ra ashimbɔ use abokmbɔ. Awu umbɔ abvui abɛk nggu urhɛ na agha iyɛrhe nggu Ukiristo imɛka unaku ugɔnga. <verse eid="REV 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5"/>Akɛrɛ ake awu inggbaashi isisok ra akpe. Abɔɔ aka akpe asi ibvui abɛkmbɔ, utsɛku imɛka unaku ugɔng hã iki imaa. <verse eid="REV 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6"/>Idorh nu isisar iwe iyi abirabɛ aka akpo ugau ri isisok ra akpe aki inggbaashi ha. Akpe aki uvaa ashike ri ijee ri atsimbɔ, bɔr umbɔ awuri iwe abika adzowe idɛm-Num abi Unum na abi Ukiristo, awuri igha iyɛrhe nggu unga imɛka unaku ugɔnga.<verse eid="REV 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ininang ni itsi Undenggũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7"/>Ivangyɛ imɛk unaku ugɔng hã iki itɔng, umbɔ awuri itsũwe Ushaitan ra anangkɛ umbɔ aka agbange unga. <verse eid="REV 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8"/>Unga ikɛi adzek arhɛm anera aka asita asei ra angboka anaa aki upfunga, abĩã umbɔ aki iyisa Ugog nu Umagog. Awuri ikɔng umbɔ itang iwa, irhɛmbɔ iwuri iwe ru nyaku uzuzeu ubang azɛ̃ akagɔng. <verse eid="REV 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9"/>Umbɔ adzek azɛ̃rhã atɔng ru upfunga kishoo, adziirte anang isei aki asarkasar aner Unum, uteukpi unga aka abema. Bɔr urha udzeka afã ukpĩĩwe umbɔ. <verse eid="REV 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10"/>Nu Undenggũ hã, uwuku urhɛm umbɔ, atare unga ru ukau urha ukpuku ukpĩĩ nggu urha uku uterha, anangkɛ umbɔ aka atare ijuɛ arhum iyiki ibewe ha nggu uner uwuku usɔm Arherhu-Num igbɛrangwĩ. Umɔ, umbɔ awuri ihwa ayetnum ru untsuu nu atenum ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa.<verse eid="REV 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atsu uvau ra abika akpe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã nggaa anang isei aka aterha nu uwuku usei umɔ. Abĩ nu afafã agwirke ra asunga, ikɛi asi ibvui anyãmbɔ ake. <verse eid="REV 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12"/>Nu umum inyã abika akpe, ukugɔng nu uku uci, aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra asu anang isei ha. Umbɔ ayanga abvur akɔɔ, ikɛi ayangumbɔ ubvur urhɛ. Atsu uvau nu abika akpe ru ubinkpi umbɔ aka akorhe ru nyaka ngge iki itsɛng ra abvur ha. <verse eid="REV 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13"/>Azɛ̃ akagɔng akũ abirabɛ aka akpe ra ake adzeka, akpe nu anang isei abika akpukpe adzowe abika akpe aka awe ra ake, nu ubɛn unera umbɔ atsu uvaunga ru ubinkpi unga aka akorhe. <verse eid="REV 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14"/>Mɔcɛ akpe nu anang isei abika akpukpe, umbɔ atare ake ru ukau urha. Ukau urha ha uwu akpe aki uvaa. <verse eid="REV 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15"/>Ubɛn unerwi aka asi itsɛngmbɔ itsoknga ru ubvur urhɛ, awuri itare unga ru ukau urha ha.<verse eid="REV 20:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Urusharhima uku ufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1"/>Mɔcɛ umum inyã afã aka afa nu abĩ aka afa, ubinkutsu afã aki inggbaashia nu abĩ aki inggbaashia aka agwirke, nu akau azɛ̃ akagɔng ashike. <verse eid="REV 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2"/>Umum inyã usarkasar uteu ukugɔng hã, Urusharhima uku ufa, udzeka ra anang Unum ra afã ucipuwa, agbisha ukpɔ ru nyaku utsɛrh uku ufa aki igbɛr idzam ru utsaknga. <verse eid="REV 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3"/>Umum igũ urhɛm ukeker uku udzeka anang isei ha ugɔr ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Icɛrɛ anang Unum awe nggu anera! Unga awuri isei nggu umbɔ. Umbɔ awuri iwe anernga, Unum iganga awuri iwe nggu umbɔ, na awe Unummbɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4"/>Unga awuri ifire ubɛn anyĩ ra asumbɔ. Akpe awuri ishike use idamɛn use iciu akpe, use ighighong, ubinkutsu abin aki isha aka atɔngke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5"/>Unga uwuku usei ra anang isei ha agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Umum iwuri itsu abina kishoo awe akika afa!&gt;&gt; Mɔcɛ unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Utsɛng akɛrɛ ha, ubinkutsu arherhe akɛrɛ awe idzidzɛrhe icicang ishingge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6"/>Unga agɔr umum agɛ, &lt;&lt;Aka akorhuke. Umum iwe Uarhfa nu Umega, itirhi nu imimasha. Uwuku ugũ ugɔ̃ amɛ̃, umum iwuri indzowukũ ijeea unga ahwa ra akwiu amɛ̃ urhɛ izũwã. <verse eid="REV 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7"/>Uwuruwi aka abima adɛ̃ɛ̃ nggu umum, awuri inyãngu ukam abin akɛrɛ kishoo, nu umum iwuri iwe Unumnga nu unga awe ungwɛ̃mum. <verse eid="REV 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8"/>Bɔr abika asheri ikeramɛn, abika asheri imangmang, nu abi amɛn akatãrhã, nu abika afɛr aner, nu abika atoma-dak, nu abika atɔ̃ itser idzim, nu abika adzowe igɔng ra agberhe, nu abi igbɛrangwĩ, anangmbɔ awe ru ukau urha uku uterha. Akɛrɛ ake awe akpe aki uvaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9"/>Unying ri ípfu itser-Num hã utɔɔva iyiki ikpɔm atɛ̃rhã azɔu aka atɔk nggu íkpo ha iyi imaataka, iba igɔr umum igɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba umum idɛyiwa utsɛrh uwuku ufa ha, utsɛrha Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10"/>Ipfu-Num icipuwa ni itsimum, ipfu itser-Num hã ikũna umum izĩngge ni itsi nggaa undender igũ, idɛyiwa umum Urusharhima, usarkasar uteu ukpuku ugɔng ukpu Unum ra afã uku ucipuwa. <verse eid="REV 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11"/>Urhang nggu ikpikpoi Unum, irhirhangge iwu ru nyaku utarh ukpuku uwu ru ugarh, uku uwe uzeze ni irhang ru nyaki irhi iki irhang. <verse eid="REV 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12"/>Uteu ha uwu ru nggaa ubandzin udedetakpɔ, nggu angwĩ ubãke usɔkdũmɛn ípfu itser-Num usɔkdũmɛn iki idzɛu ingwĩ ubandzin hã. Atsɛng atsok anang usɔkdũmɛn iyi Uisrairha nu ingwĩ ubandzin hã. <verse eid="REV 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13"/>Ingwĩ ubandzin hã iwu itaar udiki igɔ̃kpee, itaar udiku unɔr, itaar udiku ufã, itaar udiku urhɛɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14"/>Ikɛi adzin ubandzin uteu ha nu atarh idzin usɔkdũmɛn, umbɔ atsɛng atsok abi itser Uyesu usɔkdũmɛn aki Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha.<verse eid="REV 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15"/>Ipfu itser-Num hã iki irherha arherhe nggu umum iwe ru igbong iyiki imei ider nu ikpina ukpu uzinarhi iyiriyɛ aka akũ amei uteu ha, nu angwĩke, nu abandzinke. <verse eid="REV 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16"/>Uteu ha uwu ra angboka anaa, iderngge nggu itɛingge iwu icaica. Ipfu itser-Num ikũ igbong iyiki imei ider nu ikpina ha amei uteu hã, akpo iderngge, akirhomita anaka agɔnga avaa na anaka anaa (2,400) iderkpɔ, nu itɛikpɔ, nu ikpinakpɔ kishoo iwu icaica. <verse eid="REV 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17"/>Ipfu itser-Num hã imei ubandzinkpɔ, ikpo iderkpɔ adaka anaka avaa (200) ru ubin ukpuku umumei ukpu anera aki ikũ amei abin. <verse eid="REV 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18"/>Akũ atarh aka awu ru ugarh aki ujasfa adzin ubandzin hã, akũ uzinarhi uku usar adzin uteu ha, ukpɔ urhang ru nyaki irhi. <verse eid="REV 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19"/>Agbɛre idzam nu atarh idzin hã nggu ubɛn ikpũ atarh aka awu ru ugarh. Atsu atarh aki ujasfa ri inggbaashia, aki uvaa atarh usaffaya, aki untaar atarh uagat, aki unaa atarh uzumurudu, <verse eid="REV 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20"/>aki untɔ̃ɔ̃ atarh ubani, aki utɔ̃ĩ atarh ukarnerhiyan, aki utɔɔva atarh ukirisorhat, aki utɔrɔk atarh ubirirh, aki utɔɔrha atarh utofa, aki usɔka atarh ukirisofura, aki usɔka nu unying atarh ujasin, aki usɔka na avaa atarh uameti. <verse eid="REV 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21"/>Angwĩ ubã ubandzin hã awu usɔkdũmɛn awe urhu'urhu usɔkdũmɛn, akũ urhu'urhu unying agbisha ubɛn angwĩ ubandzin hã. Akũ uzinarhi uku usar agbisha atsĩndĩ uteu ha, ake arhang ru nyaki irhi.<verse eid="REV 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22"/>Umum isi inyãmum Iya-Num ru uteu ha, ubinkutsu, Uteijee Unum Uner Ijee nu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha, umbɔ awu Iya-Num uteu ha. <verse eid="REV 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23"/>Uteu ha usi ibeekpɔ ishaa unum, use ufɛ̃ iki irhange ukpɔ, ubinkutsu, ikpikpoi Unum ngge irhange ukpɔ, nu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha unga awu irhirhang uteu ha. <verse eid="REV 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24"/>Abĩã awuri izɛ̃rhã ri irhirhang uteu ha, ayɛrhe abĩã ikɛi awuri ikũ abinmbɔ akũwe ukpɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25"/>Asi ífɔmmbɔ ingwĩ uteu ha, ubinkutsu, utsuu ushikpɔ umɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26"/>Awuri ikũ abin ikpikpoi nu igɔng iyi abĩã, akũ aba ru uteu ha. <verse eid="REV 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27"/>Bɔr abin arhim asi ítsĩke ru uteu ha, use uwɔɔ uner uwuku ukorha abin ishĩ, use uner igbɛrangwĩ. Akpurha awu abirabɛ atsokmbɔ aka atsɛng ru ubvur uwu urhɛ uwu Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha umbɔ awuri itsĩ ru uteu ha.<verse eid="REV 21:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Azɛ̃ aki urhɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1"/>Mɔcɛ ipfu itser-Num hã idɛyiwa umum azɛ̃ amɛ̃ aki urhɛ, akika arhang ugɛɛ irhi, adzeka anang isei Unum nu aki Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha, <verse eid="REV 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2"/>adzɛ̃rhã ra ateu utsĩndĩ nggaa uteu ha. Ubɛn ubang azɛ̃ hã acucii urhɛ adɛ̃ɛ̃ umɔ, ake aka isaka aghwɛr ikpũ ikpũrhã usɔkdũmɛn, aka isaka aghwɛr idikunga unying ru ubɛn ufɛ̃ɛ̃. Ayerhe acuciia awu akika akerhuwe abĩã. <verse eid="REV 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3"/>Asi íkpombɔ ikponum ru uteu ha. Anang isei Unum nu aki Ungwɛ̃ Itsurhi ha awuri iwe ru uteu ha, nu agãrhãnga awuri itɔ̃we unga itser. <verse eid="REV 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4"/>Awuri inyãmbɔ asunga, itsoknga iwuri itsɛng nu ashimbɔ. <verse eid="REV 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5"/>Utsuu usi íwekpɔ. Asi íbeembɔ irhirhang, ubinkutsu Uteijee Unum unga awuri iwe irhirhangmbɔ. Umbɔ awuri igha iyɛrhe ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa. <verse eid="REV 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6"/>Ipfu itser-Num hã igɔr umum igɛ, &lt;&lt;Arherha akɛrɛ awe idzidzɛrhe, icicang ishingge. Uteijee ha, Unum hã uwuku ukpɔm ípfu abika asɔm Arherhu-Num, adene ipfu itsernga ngge idɛyiwe agãrhãnga ubinkpi uku usi ídãrhũkpɔ nu ukorhe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyesu uwɔ abarɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7"/>&lt;&lt;Nggayɛ umum iwuri ĩba iki ifefetem! Idorh iwe iyi abirabɛ aka adɔsa arherhe abika asɔm Arherhu-Num ru ubvur uwurɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8"/>Umum, Uyohana, umum igũ ni inyã abin akɛrɛ. Ivangyɛ umum iki igũ ni inyã ake, umum igba inũ ra adak ipfu itser-Num hã ngge iki idɛyiwa umum ake ni ibee indzowe ngge igɔng. <verse eid="REV 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9"/>Bɔr ngge igɔr umum igɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba ukorhungo rimi! Umum iwu undɔka itser nggu ungo nu angwɛ̃mbi abika asɔm Arherhu-Num, nu kishoo abika adɔsa arherhe ubvur uwurɛ. Udzowe igɔng ru Unum!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10"/>Mɔcɛ ngge igɔr umum igɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba uwɔkɔ arherhu uwuku asɔm Arherhu-Num akɛrɛ ru ubvur uwurɛ, ubinkutsu ivanga iki iyongge. <verse eid="REV 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11"/>Uneke uwuku ukorhe iyiki ibewe, adɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhe iki ibewe, ikɛi uwuku ukorhe abin ishĩ, adɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhe abin ishĩ, uwuku ukorhe iyiki irhika, adɛ̃ɛ̃ akorhe iyiki irhika, uwuku ususar, adɛ̃ɛ̃ akorha abin aka asusar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12"/>Uyesu agɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka anyã umum isi índãrhũmum ni ĩba! Umum ikpɔm nggu itosa ru ubokmum, umum iwuri idzowe ubɛn unera ri itseryɛ unga aka atɔ̃. <verse eid="REV 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13"/>Umum iwu Uarhfa nu Umega, inggbaashi nu imaata, ititirhi nu imimasha.<verse eid="REV 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14"/>&lt;&lt;Idorh iwe iyi abirabɛ aka asorh atorha aka adermbɔ, ngge itsú umbɔ ama akpo ijee iyiki izĩ ru ucucii urhɛ na atsĩ ra angwĩ ubandzin uteu ha. <verse eid="REV 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15"/>Bɔr abi awiya awu íjui, abika akorhi idzim, nu abika atoma-dak, nu abika afɛr anera, nu abika adzowe igɔng ra agberhe, nu abika abemi igbɛrangwĩ.<verse eid="REV 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16"/>&lt;&lt;Umum Uyesu, umum idene ipfu itsermum ngge iwuri idzaangge umbi ideka abina akɛrɛ ri ikikɔng abika adɔsa kishoo. Awu umum iwu Unang nu Ungwɛ̃ Udauda, nu irhirhang Idzɛɛr Igɔ̃kpee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17"/>Ipfu-Num nu utsɛrh uwuku ufa ha agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba!&gt;&gt; Uneke uwuku ugũ akɛrɛ ha, unga agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba!&gt;&gt; Ubɛn uwuku ugũ ugɔ̃ amɛ̃ uneke unga aba, ubɛn uwuku ububee, uneke unga ayɛi amɛ̃ urhɛ izũwã.<verse eid="REV 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imimaa arherhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18"/>Umum Uyohana, ĩgbiite ato ubɛn uwuku ugũ arherhe ru ubvur isɔm Arherhu-Num uwurɛ, unera aba atomunga urhɛm nu ake, Unum awuri itomuwe unga ikpo umbɔ aka atsɛng ru ubvur uwirɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19"/>Nu unera aba abɔruka urhɛm ru ubvur isɔm Arherhu-Num uwurɛ, Unum awuri iyɛisuka ugau ukpu uner ha ri ikpũrhũ ucucii urhɛ, nu ukpu asarkasar uteu, ru nyaka umbɔ aka asɔm ru ubvur uwurɛ.<verse eid="REV 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20"/>Uner uwuku udzowe ideka ra abin hã agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ, umum isi índãrhũmum ni ĩba!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Iwerimi. Uba, Uteijee Uyesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21"/>Uneke imimuta Uteijee Uyesu iwe nggu aner Unum. Iwerimi!<verse eid="REV 22:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22"/>
</usx>
